\section{athA.antardashAdhyAyaH || 51||}
dashAbdAH svasvamAnaghnAH sarvAyuryogabhAjitAH |
pR^ithagantardashA evaM pratyantaradashAdikAH || 1||
AdAvantardashA pAkapatestatkramato.aparAH |
evaM pratyantarAdau cha kramo j~neyo vichaxaNaiH || 2||
bhuktirnavAnAM tulyA syAd vibhAjyA navadhA dashA |
Adau dashApaterbhuktistat.hkendrAdiyujAM tataH || 3||
vidyAt krameNa bhuktyaMshAnevaM sUxmadashAdikam |
balakramAt phalaM vij~nairvaktavyaM pUrvarItitaH || 4||
kR^itvA.arkadhA rAshidashAM rAsherbhuktiM kramAd vadet |
pratyantardashAdyevaM kR^itvA tattat.hphalaM vadet || 5||
Adyasaptamayormadhye yo rAshirbalavAMstataH |
oje dashAshraye gaNyAH kramAdutkramataH same || 6||
atrA.aparo visheSho.asti bravImi tamahaM dvija |
chare.anujjhitamArgaH syAt ShaShThaShaShThAdikAH sthire || 7||
ubhaye kaNTakAj j~neyA lagnapa~nchamabhAgyataH |
charasthiradvisvabhAveShvojeShuH prAk kramo mataH || 8||
teShveva triShu yugmeShu grAhyaM vyutkramato.akhilam |
evamullikhito rAshi pAkarAshirudIryute || 9||
sa eva bhogarAshiH syAt paryAye prathame smR^itaH |
AdyAd yAvatithaH pAkaH paryAye yatra dR^ishyate || 10||
tasmAt tAvatitho bhogaH paryAye tatra gR^ihyatAm |
tadidaM charaparyAyasthiraparyAyayordvayoH || 11||
trikoNAkhyadashAyAM cha pAkabhogaprakalpanam |
pAke bhoge cha pApADhye depapIDA namovyathA || 12||
piNDatrikadashAyAM tu bravimyantardashAvidhim |
pUrNa dashApatirdad.hyAt tadardhaM tena saMyutaH || 13||
trikoNagastR^itIyAMshaM turyAMshashchaturasragaH |
smaragaH saptamaM bhAgaM bahuShveko balI grahaH || 14||
evaM salagnakAH kheTAH pAchayanti mithaH sthitAH |
samachChedIkR^itAH prAptA aMsAshChedavivarjitAH || 15||
dashAbdAH pR^ithagaMshaghnA aMshayogavibhAjitAH |
antardashA bhavantyevaM tatpratyantardashAdikAH || 16||
\section{atha viMshottarImatena sUryadashAntardashAphalAdhyAyaH || 52||}
svochche svbhe sthitaH sUryo lAbhe kendre trikoNake |
svadashAyAM svabhuktau cha dhanadhAnyAdilAbhakR^it || 1||
nIchAdyashubharAshistho viparItaM phalaM dishet |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe.arke tvapamR^ityubhayaM vadet || 2||
taddoShaparihArArthaM mR^ityu~njayajapaM charet |
sUryaprItikarIM shAntiM kuryAdArogyalabdhaye || 3||
sUryasyA.antargate chandre lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
vivAhaM shubhakAryaM cha dhanadhAnyasamR^iddhikR^it || 4||
gR^ihaxetrAbhivR^iddhiM cha pashuvAhanasampadAm |
tu~Nge vA svarxage vA.api dArasaukhyaM dhanAgamam || 5||
putralAbhasukhaM chaiva saukhyaM rAjasamAgamam |
mahArAjaprasAdena iShTasiddhisukhavAham || 6||
xINe vA pApasaMyukte dAraputrAdipoDanam |
vaiShamyaM janasaMvAdaM bhR^ityavargavinAshanam || 7||
virodhaM rAjakalahaM dhanadhAnyapashuxayam |
ShaShThAShTamavyaye chandre jalabhItiM manorujam || 8||
bandhanaM rogapIDAM cha sthAnavichyutikArakam |
duHsthAnaM chApi chittena dAyAdajanavigraham || 9||
nirdishet kutsitAnnaM cha chaurAdinR^ipapIDanam |
mUtrakR^ichChAdirogashcha dehapIDA tathA bhavet || 10||
dAyeshAllabhabhAgye cha kendre vA shubhasaMyute |
bhogabhAgyAdisantoShadAraputrAdivarddhanam || 11||
rAjyaprAptiM mahatsaukhyaM sthAnaprAptiM cha shAshvartAm |
viviAhaM yaj~nadIxAM cha sumAlyAmabarabhUShaNam || 12||
vAhanaM putrapautrAdi labhate sukhavarddhanam |
dAyeshAdripurandhrasthe vyaye vA balavarjite || 13||
akAle bhojanaM chaiva deshAddeshaM gamiShyati |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe cha hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati |
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM gadyAchChAnti kuryAtsukhAptaye || 14||
sUryasyAntargate bhaume svochche svaxetralAbhage |
lagnAtkendratrikoNe vA shubhakAryaM samAdishet || 15||
bhUlAbhaM kR^iShilAbhaM cha dhanadhAnyavivardhanam |
gR^ihaxetrAdi lAbhaM cha raktavastrAdilAbhakR^it || 16||
lagnAdhipena saMyukte saukhyaM rAjapriyaM vadet |
bhAgyalAbhAdhipairyukte lAbhashchaiva bhaviShyati || 17||
bahusenAdhipatyaM cha shatrunAshaM manodR^iDham |
Atmabandhusukham chaiva bhrAtR^ivarddhanakaM tathA || 18||
dAyeshAd.hvyayarandhrasthe pApairyukte cha vIxite |
AdhipatyabalairhIne krUrabuddhiM manorujam || 19||
kArAgR^ihe praveshaM cha kathayed bandhunAshanam |
bhrAR^ivagavirodhaM cha karmanAshamathApi vA || 20||
nIche vA durbale bhaume rAjamUlAddhanaxayaH |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehe jADyaM manorujam || 21||
subrahmajapadAnaM cha vR^iShotsargaM tathaiva cha |
shAntiM kurvIta vidyivadAyurArogyasiddhidAm || 22||
sUryasyAntargate rAhau lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
Adau dvimAsaparyantaM dhananAsho mahad.hbhayam || 23||
chaurAdivraNabhItishcha dAraputrAdipIDanam |
tatparaM sukhamApnoti shubhayukte shubhAMshake || 24||
dehArogyaM manastuShTi rAjaprItikaraM sukham |
lagnAdupachaye rAhau yogakArakasaMyute || 25||
dAyeshAchChubharAshisthe rAjasanmAnamAdishet |
bhAgyavR^iddhiM yasholAbhaM dAraputrAdipIDanam || 26||
putrotsavAdisantoShaM gR^ihe kalyANashobhanam |
dAyeshAdatha riShphasthe randhre vA balavarjite || 27||
bandhanaM sthAnanAshashcha kArAgR^ihaniveshanam |
chaurAdivraNabhItishcha dAraputrAdivarddhanam || 28||
chatuShpAjjIvanAshashcha gR^ihaxetrAdinAshanam |
gulmaxayAdirogashcha hyatisArAdipIDanam || 29||
dvisphasthe tathA rAhau tatsthAnAdhipasaMyute |
apamR^ityubhayaM chaiva sarpabhItishcha sambhavet || 30||
durgAjapaM cha kurvIt ChAgadAnaM samAcharet |
kR^iShNAM gAM mahiShIM dad.hyachChAntimApnotyasaMshayam || 31||
sUryasyAntargate jIve lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svochche mitrasya vargasthe vivAhaM rAjadarshanam || 32||
dhanadhAnyAdilAbha cha putralAbhaM mahat.hsukham |
mahArAjaprasAdena iShTakAryArthalAbhakR^it || 33||
brAhmaNpriyasanmAnaM priyavastrAdilAbhakR^it |
bhAgyakarmAdhipavashAdrAjyalAbhaM vaded dvija || 34||
naravAhanayogashcha sthAnAdhikyaM mahatsukham |
dAyeshAchChubharAshisthe bhAgyavR^iddhiH sukhAvahA || 35||
dInadharmakriyAyukto devatArAdhanapriyaH |
gurubhaktirmanaHsiddhiH puNyukarmAdisaMgrahaH || 36||
rAsheshAdripurandhrasthe nIche vA pApasaMyute |
dAraputrAdipIDA cha dehapIDA mahad.hbhayam || 37||
rAjakopaM prakurute.abhIShTavastuvinAshnam |
pApamUlad.hdravyanAshaM dehabhraShTaM manorujam || 38||
svarNadAnaM prakurvIta sveShTajApyaM cha kArayet |
gavAM kapilavarNAnAM dAnenArogyamAdishet || 39||
sUryasyAntargate mande lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
shatrunAsho mahatsaukhyaM svalpadhAnyArthalAbhakR^it || 40||
vivAhAdisukArya~ncha gR^ihe tasya shubhAvaham |
svochche svaxetrage mande suhR^id.hgrahasamanvite || 41||
gR^ihe kalyANasampattirvivAhAdiShu satkriyA |
rAjasanmAnakIrtishcha nAnAvastradhanAgamam || 42||
dAyeshAdatha randhrasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
vAtashUlamahAvyAdhijvarAtIsArapIDanam || 43||
bandhanaM kAryahAnishcha vittanAsho mahad.hbhayam |
akashmAtkalahashchaiva dAyAdajanavigrahaH || 44||
bhuktyAdau mitrahAniHsyAnmadhye ki~nchitsukhAvaham |
ante kleshakaraM chaiva nIche teShAM tathaiva cha || 45||
pitR^imAtR^iviyogashcha gamanAgamamaM tathA |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu apamR^ityubhayaM bhavet || 46||
kR^iShNAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAnmR^ityu~njayajapaM charet |
ChAgadAnaM prakurvIta sarvasampatpradAyakam || 47||
sUryAsyAntargate saumye svochche vA svarxage.api vA |
kendratrikoNalAbhasthe budhe vargabalairyute || 48||
rAjyalAbho mahotsAho dAraputrAdisaukhyakR^it |
mahArajaprasAdena vAhanAmbarabhUShaNam || 49||
puNyatIrthaphalAvAptirgR^ihe godhanasaMkulam |
bhAgyalAbhAdhipairyukte lAbhavR^iddhikoro bhavet || 50||
bhAgyapaMchamakarmasthe sanmAno bhavati dhruvam |
sukarmadharmabuddhishcha gurudevadvijArjanam || 51||
dhanadhAnyAdisaMyukto vivAhaH putrasambhavaH |
dAyeshAchChubharAshisthe saumyayukte mahatsukham || 52||
vaivAhikaM yaj~nakarma dAnadharmajapAdikam |
svanAmA~NkitapadyAni nAmadvayamathA.api vA || 53||
bhojanAmbarabhUShAptiramaresho bhavennaraH |
dAyeshAdripurandhrasthe riShphage nIchage.api vA || 54||
dehapIDA manastApo dAraputrAdipIDanam |
bhuktyAdau duHkhamApnoti madhye ki~nchit.hsukhAvaham || 55||
ante tu rAjabhItishcha gamanAgamanaM tathA |
dvitIye dyUnanAthe tu dehajADyaM jvarAdikam || 56||
viShNunAmasahasraM cha hyannadAnaM cha kArayet |
rajatapratimAdAnaM kuryAdArogyasiddhaye || 57||
sUryasyAntargate ketau dehapIDA manovyathA |
arthavyayaM rAjakopaM svajanAderupadravam || 58||
lagnAdhipena saMyukte Adau saukhyaM dhanAgamam |
madhye tatkleshamApnoti mR^itavArtAgamaM vadet || 59||
athAShTamavyaye chaivaM dAyeshAtpApasaMyute |
kapoladantarogashcha mUtrakR^irchChasya sambhavaH || 60||
sthAnavichyutirarthasya mitrahAniH piturmR^itiH |
videshagamanaM chaiva shatrupIDA mahad.hbhayam || 61||
lagnAdupachaye ketau yogakArakasaMyute |
shubhAMshe shubhavarge cha shubhakarmaphalodayaH || 62||
putradArAdisaukhyaM cha santoShaM priyavarddhanam |
vichitravastralAbhashcha yashovR^iddhiH sukhAvahA || 63||
dvitIyAdyUnanAthe vA hyapamR^ityubhayaM vadet |
durgAjapaM cha kurvIta ChAgadAnaM sukhAptaye || 64||
sUryasyAntargate shukre trikoNe kendrage.api vA |
svochche mitrasvavargasthe.abhIShTastrIbhogyasampadaH || 65||
grAmAntaraprayANaM cha bhAhmaNaprabhudarshanam |
rAjyalAbho mahotsAhashChatrachAmaravaibhavam || 66||
gR^ihe kalyANasampattirnityaM miShThAnnabhojanam |
vidrumAdiratnalAbho muktAvastrAdi lAbhakR^it || 67||
chatuShpAjjIvalAbhaH syAd.hbahudhAnyadhanAdikam |
utsAhaH kIrtisampattirnaravAhanasampadaH || 68||
ShaShThAShTamavyaye shukre dAyeshAd.hbalavarjite |
rAjakopo manaHkleshaH putrastrIdhananAshanam || 69||
bhuktyAdau madhyamaM madhye lAbhaH shubhakaro bhavet |
ante yashonAshanaM cha sthAnabhraMshamathApi vA || 70||
bandhudveShaM vaded vApi svakulAd.hbhoganAshanam |
bhArgave dyUnanAthe tu dehe jADyaM rujobhayam || 71||
randhrariShphasamAyukte hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM mR^ityurjayajapaM charet || 72||
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdrudrajApyaM cha kArayet |
tataH shAntibhavApnoti sha~Nkarasya prasAdataH || 73||
\section{atha chandrAntardashAphalAdhyAyaH || 53||}
svochche svaxetrage chandre trikoNe lAbhage.api vA |
bhAgyakarmAdhipairyukte gajAshvAmbarasaMkulam || 1||
devatAgurubhaktishcha puNyashlokAdikIrtanam |
rAjyalAbho mahatsaukhyaM yashovR^iddhiH sukhAvahA || 2||
pUrNe chandre balaM pUrNaM senApatyaM mahatsukham |
pApayukte.athavA chandre nIche vA riShphaShaShThage || 3||
atakAle dhananAshaH syAtsthAnachyutirathApi vA |
dehalasyaM manastapo rAjamantrivirodhakR^it || 4||
mAtR^iklesho manoduHkhaM nigaDaM bandhunAshanam |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu randhrariShpheshasaMyute || 5||
dehajADyaM mahAbha~NgamapamR^ityobhayaM vadet |
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAt svadashAntargate vidhau || 6||
chandrasyAntargate bhaume lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
saubhAgyaM rAjasanmAnaM vastrabharaNabhUShaNam || 7||
yatnAt kAryArthasiddhistu bhaviShyati na saMshayaH |
gR^ihaxetrAbhivR^iddhishcha vyavahAre jayo bhavet || 8||
kAryalAbho mahatsaukhyaM svochche svaxetrage phalam |
tathA.aShTamavyaye bhaume pApayukte.atha vA yadi || 9||
dAyashAdashubhasthAne dehArtiH paravIxite |
gR^ihaxetrAdihAnishcha vyavahAre tathA xatiH || 10||
mR^ityuvargeShu kalaho bhUpAlasya virodhanam |
Atmabandhuviyogashcha nityaM niShThurabhAShaNam || 11||
dvitIye dyUnanAthe tu randhre randhrAdhipo yadA |
tattoShaparihArArthaM brAhmaNasyA.archanaM charet || 12||
chandrasyAntargate rAhau lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
Adau svalphalaM j~neyaM shatrupIDA mahad.hbhayam || 13||
chaurAhirAjabhItishcha chatuShpAjjivapIDanam |
bandhunAsho mitrahAnirmAnahAnirmanovyathA || 14||
shubhayukte shubhairdR^iShTe lagnAdupachaye.api vA |
yogakArakasambandhe sarvakAryArthasiddhikR^it || 15||
nairR^itye pashchime bhAve kvachitprabhusamAgamaH |
vAhanAmabaralAbhashcha sveShTakAryArthasiddhikR^it || 16||
dAyeshAdatha randhrathe vyaye vA balavarjite |
sthAnabhraMsho manodukhaM putraklesho mahad.hbhayam || 17||
dArapIDA kvachijj~neyA kvachit.hsvA~Nge rujobhayam |
vR^ishchikAdiviShAd.hbhItishchaurAhinR^ipapIDanam || 18||
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe va dushchikye lAbhage.api vA |
puNyatIrthaphalAvAptirdevatAdarshanaM mahat || 19||
paropakArakarmAdipuNyakarmAdisamprahaH |
dvitIyadyUnarAshithe dehabAdhA bhaviShyati || 20||
taddoShaparihArArthaM rudrajApyaM samAcharet |
ChAgadAnaM prakurvIta dehArogyaM prajAyate || 21||
chandrasyAntargate jIve lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svagehe lAbhage svochche rAjyalAbho mahotsavaH || 22||
vastrA.ala~NkArabhUShAptI rAjaprItirdhanAgamaH |
iShTadevaprasAdena garbhAdhAnAdikaM phalam || 23||
tathA shobhanakAryANi gR^ihe laxmIH kaTAxakR^it |
rAjAshrayaM dhanaM bhUmigajavAjisamanvitam || 24||
mahArAjaprasAdena sveShTasiddhiH sukhAvahA |
ShaShThAShTamavyaye jIve nIcha vAsta~Ngate yadi || 25||
pApayukte.ashubhaM karma guruputrAdinAshanam |
sthAnabhraMsho manoduHkhamakasmAtkalaho dhruvam || 26||
gR^ihaxetrAdinAshashcha vAhanAmbaranAshanam |
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA dushchikye lAbhage.api vA || 27||
bhojanAmbaraparavAdi=lAbhaM saukhyaM karoti cha |
brhAtrAdisukhasampattiM dhairyaM vIryaparAkramam || 28||
yaj~navratavivAhAdirAjyashrIdhanasampadaH |
dAyeshAdripurandhrasthe vyaye vA balavarjite || 29||
karoti kutsinAnnaM cha videshagamanaM tathA |
bhuktyAdau shobhanaM proktamante kleshakaraM bhavet || 30||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe cha hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM shivasAhasrakaM japet |
svarNadAnamiti proktaM sarvakaShTanivArakam || 31||
chandrasyAntargate mande lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svaxetre svAMshage chaiva mande tu~NgAMshasaMyute || 32||
shubhadR^iShTayute vA.api lAbhe vA balasaMyute |
putramitrArthasampattiH shUdraprabhusamAgamAt || 33||
vyayasAyAtphalAdhikyaM gR^ihe xetrAdivR^iddhidam |
putralAbhashcha kalyANaM rAjAnugrahavaibhavam || 34||
ShaShThAShTamavyaye mande nIche vA dhanage.api vA |
tad.hbhuktyAdau puNyatIrthe snAnaM chaiva tu darshanam || 35||
anekajanatrAsashcha shastrapIDA bhaviShyati |
dAyeshAtkendrarAshisthe trikoNe balage.api vA || 36||
kvachitsaukhyaM dhanAptishcha dAraputravirodhakR^it |
dvitIyadyUnarandhrasthe dehabAdhA bhaviShyati || 37||
taddoShaparihArArthaM mR^ityu~njayajapaM charet |
kR^iShNAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAddAnemArogyamAdishet || 38||
chandrasyAntargate saumye kendralAbhatrikoNage |
svarxe nijAMshake saumye tu~Nge vA balasaMyute || 39||
dhanAgamo rAjamAnapriyavastrAdilAbhakR^it |
vidyAvinodasad.hgoShThI j~nAnavR^iddhiH sukhAvahA || 40||
santAnaprAptiH santoSho vANijyAddhanalAbhkR^it |
vAhanachChatrasaMyuktanAnAla~NkAralAbhakR^it || 41||
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA lAbhe vA dhanage.api vA |
vivAho yaj~nadIxA cha dAnadharmashubhAdikam || 42||
rAjaprItikarashchaiva vidvajjanasamAgamaH |
muktAmaNipravAlAni vAhanAmbarabhUShaNam || 43||
ArogyaprItisaukhyaM cha somapAnAdikaM sukham |
dAyeshAdripurandhrasthe vyaye vA nIchage.api vA || 44||
tad.hbhuktau dehabAdhA cha kR^irShigobhUminAshanam |
kArAgR^ihapraveshAshcha dAraputrAdipIDanam || 45||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu jvarapIDA mahad.hbhayam |
ChAgadAnaM prakurvIta viShNusAhasrakaM japet || 46||
chandrasyAntargate ketau kendralAbhatrikoNage |
dushchikye balasaMyukte dhanalAbhaM mahatsukham || 47||
putradArAdisaukhyaM cha vidhikarma karoti cha |
bhuktyAdau dhanahAniH syAnmadhyage sukhamApnuyAt || 48||
dAyeshAtkendralAbhe vA trikoNe balasaMyute |
kvachitphalaM dashAdau tu dadyAt saukhyaM dhanAgamam || 49||
gomahiShyAdilAbhaM cha bhuktyante chArthanAshanam |
pApayukte.athavA dR^iShTe dAyeshAdrandhrariHphage || 50||
shatrutaH kAryahAniH syAdakasmAtkalaho dhruvam |
dvitIyadyUnarAshistyhe hyanArogyaM mahad.hbhayam || 51||
mR^ityu~njayajapaM kuryAt sarvasampatpradAyakam |
tataH shAntimavApnoti sha~Nkarasya prasAdataH || 52||
chandrasyAntargate shukre kendralAbhatrikoNage |
svochche svaxetrage vApi rAjyalAbhaM karoti cha || 53||
mahArAjaprasAdena vAhanAmbarabhUShaNam |
chatuShpAjjivalAbhaH syAddAraputrAdivardhanam || 54||
nUtanAgAranirmANaM nityaM miShThAnnabhojanam |
sugandhapuShpamAlyAdiramyastryArogyasampadam || 55||
dashAdhipena saMyukte dehasaukhyaM mahatsukham |
satkIrtisukhasampattigR^ihaxetrAdivR^iddhikR^it || 56||
nIche vA.asta~Ngate shukre pApagrahayutexite |
bhUnAshaH putramitrAdinAshanaM patninAshanam || 57||
chatuShpAjjivahAniH syAdrAjadvAre virodhakR^it |
dhanasthAnagate shukre svachche svaxetrasaMyute || 58||
nidhilAbhaM mahatsaukhyaM bhU lAbhaM putrasambhavam |
bhAgyalAbhAdipairyukte bhAgyavR^iddhiH karotyasau || 59||
mahArAjaprasAdena sveShTasiddhiH sukhAvahA |
devabrAhmaNabhaktishcha muktavidrumalAbhakR^it || 60||
dAyashAllAbhage shukre trikoNe kendrage.api vA |
gR^ihaxetrAbhivR^iddhishcha vittalAbho mahatsukham || 61||
dAyeshAdripurandhrasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
videshavAsaduHkhArtimR^ityuchaurAdipIDanam || 62||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu apamR^ityubhayaM bhavet |
taddoShavinivR^ittyarthaM rudrajApyaM cha kArayet || 63||
shvetAM gAM rajataM dadyAchChantimApnotyasaMshayaH |
sha~Nkarasya prasAdena nA.atra kAryA vichAraNA || 64||
chandrasyAntargate bhAnau svochche svaxetrasaMyute |
kendre trikoNe lAbhe vA dhane vA sodarAlaye || 65||
naShTarAjyadhanaprAptirgR^ihe kalyANashobhanam |
mitrarAjaprasAdena grAmabhUmyAdilAbhkR^it || 66||
garbhAdhAnaphalaprAptirgR^ihe laxmIH kaTAxakR^it |
bhuktyante deha AlasyaM jvarapIDA bhaviShyati || 67||
dAyeshAdapi randhrasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
nR^ipachaurAhibhItishcha jvararogAdisambhavaH || 68||
videshagamane chArti labhate na saMshayaH |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu jvarapIDA bhaviShyati || 69||
taddoShaparihArArthaM shivapUjAM cha kArayet |
tataH shAntibhavApnoti shA~Nkarasya prasAdataH || 70||
\section{atha kujadashAntardashAphalAdhyAyaH || 54||}
kuje svAntargate vipra lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
lAbhe vA shubhasaMyukte duShchikye dhanasaMyute || 1||
lagnAdhipena saMyukte rAjA.anugrahavaibhavam |
laxmIkaToxachihnAni naShTarAjyArthalAbhakR^it || 2||
putrotsavAdisantoSho gR^ihe goxIrasa~Nkalam |
svochche vA svarxage bhaume svAMshe vA balasaMyute || 3||
gR^ihaxetrAbhivR^iddhishcha gomahiShyAdilAbhakR^it |
mahArAjaprasAdena sveShTasiddhiH sukhAvahA || 4||
athA.aShTamavyaye bhaume pApadR^ig.hyogasaMyute |
mUtrakR^irchChAdirogashcha kaShTAdhikyaM vraNAd.hbhayam || 5||
chaurAhirAjapIDA cha dhanadhAnyaparuxayaH |
dvitIye dyUnanAthe tu dehajADyaM manovyathA || 6||
taddoShaparihArArthaM rudrajApyaM cha kArayet |
anaD.hvAhaM pradadvAchcha kujadoShanivR^ittaye || 7||
tena tuShTo bhaved bhaumaH sha~Nkarasya prasAdataH |
ArogyaM kurute tasya sarvasampattidAyakam || 8||
kujasyAntargate rAhau svochche mUlatrikoNage |
shubhairyukte shubhairdR^iShTe kendralAbhatR^ikoNage || 9||
tatkAle rAjasammAnaM gR^ihabhUmyAdilAbhakR^it |
kalatraputralAbhaH syAd.hvyavasAyAtphalAdhikam || 10||
ga~NgAsnAnaphalAvAptiM videshagamanaM tathA |
tathA.aShTamavyaye rAhau pApayukte.atha vIxite || 11||
chaurAhivraNabhItishcha chatuShpAjjIvanashanam |
vAtapittarujobhItiH kArAgR^ihaniveshanam || 12||
dhanasthAnagate rAhau dhananAs.haM mahad.hbhayam |
saptamasthAnage vA.api hyapamR^ityubhayaM mahat || 13||
nAgapUjAM prakurvIta devabrAhmaNabhojanam |
mR^ityu~njayajapaM kuryAdAyurArogyalabdhaye || 14||
kujasyAntargate jIve trikoNe kendrage.api vA |
lAbhe vA dhanasaMyukte tu~NgAMshe svAMshagepi vA || 15||
satkIrtI rAjasammAnaM dhanadhAnyasya vR^iddhikR^it |
gR^ihe kalyANasampattirdAraputrAdilAbhakR^it || 16||
dAyeshAtkendrarAshisthe trikoNe lAbhage.api vA |
bhAgyakarmAdhipairyukte vAhanAdhipasaMyute || 17||
lagnAdhipasamAyukte shubhAMshe shubhavargage |
gR^ihaxetrAbhivR^iddhishcha gR^ihe kalyANasampadaH || 18||
dehArogyaM mahatkIrtigR^ihe gokulasaMgrahaH |
chatuShpAjjIvalAbhaH syAd.hvyavasAyAtphalAdhikam || 19||
kalaputrasaukhyaM cha rAjasammAnavaibhavam |
ShaShThAShTamavyaye jIve nIche vAstaMgate sati || 20||
pApagraheNa saMyukte dR^iShTe vA durbale sati |
chaurAhinR^ipabhItishcha pittarogAdisambhavam || 21||
pretabAdhA bhR^ityanAshaH sodarANAM vinAshanam |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu hyapamR^ityujvarAdikam |
taddoShaparihArArthaM shivasAhasrakaM japet || 22||
kujasyAntargate mande svarxe kendratrikoNage |
mUlatrikoNakendre vA tu~NgAMshe svAMshage sati || 23||
lagnAdhipatinA vApi shubhadR^iShTiyute.asite |
rAjyasaukhyaM yashovR^iddhiH svagrAme dhAnyavR^iddhikR^it || 24||
putrapautrasamAyukto gR^ihe godhanasaMgrahaH |
svavAre rAjasammAnaM svamAse putravR^iddhikR^it || 25||
nIchAdixetrage mande tathA.aShTavyayarAshige |
mlechChavargaprabhubhayaM dhanadhanyAdinAshanam || 26||
nigaDe bandhanaM vyAdhirante xetranAshakR^it |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu pApayukte mahad.hbhayam || 27||
dhananAshashcha sa~nchAre rAjadveSho manovyathA |
chaurAgninR^ipapIDA cha sahodaravinAshanam || 28||
bandhudveShaH pramAdyaishcha jIvahAnishcha jAyate |
akasmAchcha mR^iterbhItiH putradArAdipIDanam || 29||
kArAgR^ihAdibhIdishcha rAjadaNDo mahad.hbhayam |
dAyeshAtkendrarAshisthe lAbhasthe vA trikoNage || 30||
videshayAnaM labhate duShkIrtirvividhA tathA |
pApakarmarato nityaM bahujIvAdihiMsakaH || 31||
vikrayaH xetrahAnishcha sthAnabhraMsho manovyathA |
raNe parAjayashchaiva mUtrakR^irchChAnmahad.hbhayam || 32||
dAyeshAdatha randhre vA vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
tad.hbhuktau maraNaM j~neyaM nR^ipachaurAdipIDanam || 33||
vAtapIDA cha shUlAdij~nAtishtrubhayaM bhavet || 34||
taddoShaparihArArthaM mR^ityu~njayajapaM charet |
tataH sukhamavApnoti sha~Nkarasya prasAdataH || 35||
kujasyAntargate saumye lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
satkathAshchA.ajapAdAnaM dharmabuddhirmahadyashaH || 36||
nItimArgaprasa~Ngashcha nityaM miShTAnnabhojanam |
vAhanAmbarapashvAdirrAjakarma sukhAni cha || 37||
kR^iShikarmaphale siddhirvAraNAmbarabhUShaNam |
nIche vAsta~Ngate vApi ShaShThAShTavyayage.api vA || 38||
hR^idrogaM mAnahAnishcha nigaDaM bandhunAshanam |
dAraputrArthanAshaH syAchchatuShpAjjIvanAshanam || 39||
dashAdhipena saMyukte shatruvR^iddhirmahad.hbhayam |
videshagamanaM chaiva nAnArogAstathaiva cha || 40||
rAjadvAre virodhashcha kalahaH svajanairapi |
dAyeshAtkendratrikoNe vA svochche yuktArthalAbhakR^it || 41||
anekadhananAthatvaM rAjasammanameva cha |
bhUpAlayogaM kurute dhanambaravibhUShaNam || 42||
bhUravAdyamR^idaMgAdi senApatyaM mahatsukham |
vidyAvinodavimalA vastravAhanabhUShaNam || 43||
dAraputrAdivibhavaM gR^ihe laxmIH kaTAxakR^it |
dAyeshAtShaShThariHphasthe randhre vA pApasaMyute || 44||
taddAye mAnohAniH syAt.hkrUrabuddhistu krUravAk |
chaurAgninR^ipapIDA cha mArge dasyubhayAdikam || 45||
akasmAtkalahashchaiva budhamuktau na saMshayaH |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu mahAvyAdhirbhaya~NkaraH || 46||
ashvadAnaM prakurvIta viShNornAmasahasrakam |
sarvasampatpradaM vipra sarvAriShTaprashAntaye || 47||
kujasyAntargate ketau trikoNe kendrage.api vA |
dishchikye lAbhage vA.api shubhayukte shubhexite || 48||
rAjAnugrahashAntishcha bahusaukhyaM dhanAgamaH |
ki~nchitphalaM dashAdau tu bhUlAbhaH putralAbhakR^it || 49||
rAjasaMlAbhakAryANi chatuShpAjjIvalAbhakR^it |
yogakArakasaMsthAne balavIryasamanvite || 50||
putralAbho yashovR^iddhirgR^ihe laxmIH kaTAxakR^it |
bhR^ityavargadhanaprAptiH senApatyaM mahatsukham || 51||
bhUpAlamitraM kurute yAgAmbarAdibhUShaNam |
dAyeshAtShaShThariHphasthe randhre vA pApasaMyute || 52||
kalaho dantarogashcha chauravyAghrAdipIDanam |
jvarAtisArakuShThAdidAraputrAdipIDanam || 53||
dvitIyasaptamasthAne dehe vyAdhirbhaviShyati |
apamAnamanastApo dhanadhAnyAdiprachyutim || 54||
kujasyAntargate shukre kendralAbhatrikoNage |
svochche vA svarxage vA.apishubhasthAnAdhipe.athavA || 55||
rAjyalAbho mahatsaukhyaM gajAshvAmbarabhUShaNam |
lagnAdhipena sambandhe putradArAdivardhanam || 56||
AyuSho vR^iddhiraishvaryaM bhAgyavR^iddhisukhaM bhavet |
dAyeshAtkendrakoNasthe lAbhe vA dhanage.api vA || 57||
tatkAle shriyamApnoti putralAbhaM mahatsukham |
svaprabhoshcha mahatsaukhyaM dhanavastrAdilAbhakR^it || 58||
mahArajaprasAdena grAmabhUmyAdilAbhadam |
bhuktyante phalamApnoti gItanR^ityAdilAbhakR^it || 59||
puNyatIrthasnAnalAbhaM karmAdhipasamanvite |
puNyadharmadayAkUpataDAgaM kArayiShyati || 60||
dAyeshAdrandhrariShphasthe ShaShThe vA pApasaMyute |
karoti duHkhabAhulyaM dehapIDAM dhanaxayam || 61||
rAjachaurAdibhIti~ncha gR^ihe kalahameva cha |
dAraputrAdipIDAM cha gomahiShyAdinAshakR^it || 62||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehabAdhA bhaviShyati |
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdAyurArogyavR^iddhaye || 63||
kujasyAntargate sUrye svochche svaxetrakendrage |
mUlatrikoNalAbhe vA bhAgyakarmeshasaMyute || 64||
tad.hbhuktau vAhanaM kIrtiM putralAbhaM cha vindati |
dhanadhAnyasamR^iddhiH syAd gR^ihe kalyANasampadaH || 65||
xemArogyaM mahaddhairyaM rAjapUjyaM mahatsukham |
vyavasAyAtphalAdhikyaM videshe rAjadarshanam || 66||
dAyeshAtShaShThariShphe vA vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
dehapIDA manastApaH kAryahAnirmahad.hbhayam || 67||
shirorogo jvarAdishcha atisAramathApi vA |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu sarpajvaraviShAd.hbhayam || 68||
sutapIDAbhayaM chaiva shAnti kuryAdyathAvidhi |
dehArogyaM prakurute dhanadhAnyachayaM tathA || 69||
kujasyAntargate chandre svochche svaxetrakendrage |
bhAryavAhanakarmeshalagnAdhipasamanvite || 70||
karoti vipulaM rAjyaM gandhamAlyAmbarAdikam |
taDAgaM gopurAdInAM puNyadharmAdisaMgraham || 71||
vivAhotsavakarmANi dAraputrAdisaukhyakR^it |
pitR^imAtR^isukhAvAptiM gR^ihe laxmIH kaTAxakR^it || 72||
mahArajaprasAdena sveShTasiddhisukhAdikam |
pUrNe chandre pUrNaphalaM xINe svalpaphalM bhavet || 73||
nIchAristha.aShTame ShaShThe dAyeshAdripurandhrake |
maraNaM dAraputrANAM kaShTaM bhUmivinAshanam || 74||
pashudhAnyaxayashchaiva chaurAdiraNabhItikR^it |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati || 75||
dehajADyaM manoduHkhaM durgA laxmIjapaM charet |
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdanemArogyamAdishet || 76||
\section{atha rahvantardashAphalAdhyAyaH || 55||}
kulIre vR^ishchike rAhau kanyAyAM chApage.api vA |
tad.hbhuktau rAjasammAnaM vastravAhanabhUShaNam || 1||
vyavasAyAtphalAdhikyaM chatuShpAjjIvalAbhakR^it |
prayANaM pashchime bhAge vAhanAmbaralAbhakR^it || 2||
lagnAdupachaye rAhau shubhagrahayutexite |
mitrAMshe tu~NgabhAgAMshe yogakArakasaMyute || 3||
rAjyalAbhaM mahotsAhaM rAjaprItiM shubhAvaham |
karoti sukhasampattiM dAraputrAdivarddhanam || 4||
lagnAShTme vyaye rAhau pApayukte.atha vIxite |
chaurAdivraNapIDA cha sarvatraivaM bhaved.hdvija || 5||
rAjadvArajanadveSha iShTabandhuvinAshanam |
dAraputrAdipIDA cha bhavatyeva na saMshayaH || 6||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe vA saptamasthAnamAshrite |
sadA rogo mahAkaShTaM shAntiM kuryAdyathAvidhi |
ArogyaM sampadashchaiva bhaviShyanti tadA dvija || 7||
rAhurantargate jIve lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svochche svaxetrage vApi tu~NgasvarxAMshage.api vA || 8||
sthAnalAbhaM manodhairyaM shatrunAshaM mahatsukham |
rAjaprItikaraM saukhyaM jano.atIva samashnute || 9||
dinedine vR^iddhirapi sitapaxe shashI yathA |
vAhanAdidhanaM bhUri gR^ihe godhanasaMkulam || 10||
nairR^itye pashchime bhAge prayANaM rAjadarshanam |
yuktakAryArthasiddhiH syAtsvadeshe punareShyati || 11||
upakAro brAhmaNAnAM tIrthayAtrAdikarmaNAm |
vAhanagrAmalAbhashcha devabrAhmaNapUjanam || 12||
putrotsavAdisantoSho nityaM miShThAnnabhojanam |
nIche vA.asta~Ngate vApi ShaShThAShTavyayarAshige || 13||
shatruxetre pApayukte dhanahAnirbhaviShyati |
karmavighno bhavettasya mAnahAnishcha jAyate || 14||
kalatraputrapIDA cha hR^idrogo rAjakArakR^it |
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA lAbhe vA dhanage.api vA || 15||
dushchikye balasampUrNe gR^ihaxetrAdivR^iddhikR^it |
bhojanAmbarapashvAdidAnadharmajapAdikam || 16||
bhuktyante rAjakopAchcha dvimAsaM dehapIDanam |
jyeShThabhrAturvinAshashcha mAtR^ipitrAdipIDanam || 17||
dAyeshAtShaShTharandhre vA riHphe vA pApasaMyute |
tad.hbhuktau dhanahAniH syAddehapIDA bhaviShyati || 18||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe vA hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati |
svarNasya prtimAdAnaM shivapUjaM cha kAryate || 19||
sr/Ishambhoshcha prasAdena grahastuShTo dvijottama |
dehArogyaM prakurute shAntiM kuryAdvichaxaNam || 20||
rAhorantargate mande lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svochche mUlatrikoNe vA dushchikye lAbharAshige || 21||
tad.hbhuktau nR^ipateH sevA rAjaprItikarI shubhA |
vivAhotsavakAryANi kR^itvA puNyAni bhUrishaH || 22||
ArAmakaraNe yukto taDAgaM kArayiShyati |
shUdraprabhuvashAdiShTalAbho godhanasaMgrahaH || 23||
prayANaM pashchime bhAge prabhumUlAddhanaxayaH |
dehAlasyaM phalAlpatvaM svadeshe punareShyati || 24||
nIchArixetrage mande randhre vA vyayage.api vA |
nIchArirAjabhItishcha dAraputrAdipIDanam || 25||
AtmabandhumanastApaM dAyAdajanavigraham |
vyavahAre cha kalahamakasmAd.hbhUShaNaM labhet || 26||
dAyeshAtShaShThariShphe vA randhre vA pApasaMyute |
hR^idrogo mAnahAnishcha vivAdaH shatrupIDanam || 27||
anyadeshAdisa~nchAro gulmavadvayAdhibhAgbhavet |
kubhojanaM kodravAdi jAtiduHkhAd.hbhayaM bhavet || 28||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati |
kR^iShNAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAddAnemArogyamAdishet || 29||
rAhorantargate saumye bhAgye vA svarxage.api vA |
tu~Nge vA kendrarAshisthe putre vA balage.api vA || 30||
rAjayogaM prakurute gR^ihe kalyANavarddhanam |
vyApAreNa dhanaprAptividyAvAhanamuttamam || 31||
vivAhotsavakAryANi chatuShpAjjIvalAbhakR^it |
saumyamAse mahatsaukhyaM svavAre rAjadarshanam || 32||
sugandhapuShpashayyAdi strIsaukhyaM chAtirobhanam |
mahArAjaprasAdena dhanalAbho mahadyashaH || 33||
dAyeshAtkendralAbhe vA dushchikye bhAgyakarmage |
dehArogyaM hR^idutsAha iShTasiddhiH sukhAvahA || 34||
puNyashlokAdikIrtishcha purANashravaNAdikam |
vivAho yaj~nadIxA cha dAnadharmadayAdikam || 35||
ShaShThAShTamavyaye saumye mandenApi yutexite |
dAyeshAtShaShThariHphe vA randhre vA pApasaMyute || 36||
devabhAhmaNanindA cha bhogabhAgyavivarjitaH |
satyahInashcha durbuddhishchaurAhinR^ipapIDanam || 37||
akasmAtkalahashchaiva guruputrAdinAshanam |
arthavyayo rAjakopo dAraputrAdipIDanam || 38||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe vA hyapamR^ityubhayaM vadet |
taddoShaparihArArthaM viShNusAhasrakaM japet || 39||
rAhorantargate ketau bhramaNaM rAjato bhayam |
vAtajvarAdirogashcha chatuShpAjjIvahAnikR^it || 40||
aShTamAdhisaMyukte dehajADyaM manovyathA |
shubhayukte shubhairdR^iShTe dehasaukhyaM dhanAgamaH |
rAjasammAnabhUShAptirgR^ihe shubhakaro bhavet || 41||
lagnAdhipena sambandhe iShTasiddhiH sukhAvahA |
lagnAdhipasamAyukte lAbho vA bhavati dhruvam || 42||
chatuShpAjjivalAbhaH syAtkendre vAtha trikoNage |
randhrasthAnagate ketau vyaye vA balavarjite || 43||
tad.hbhuktau bahurogaH syAchchorAhivraNapIDanam |
pitR^imAtR^iviyogashcha bhrAtR^idveSho manorujA || 44||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehabAdhA bhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM ChAgadAnaM cha kArayet || 45||
rAhorantargate shukre kagnAtkendgatrikoNage |
lAbhe vA balasaMyukte yogaprAbalyamAdishet || 46||
vipramUlAddhanaprAptirgomahiShyAdilAbhakR^it |
putrotsavAdisantoSho gR^ihe kalyANasambhavaH || 47||
sammAnaM rAjasammanaM rAjyalAbho mahatsukham |
svochche vA svarxage vApi tu~NgAMshe svAMshage.api vA || 48||
nUtanaM gR^ihanirmANaM nityaM miShThAnnabhojanam |
kalatraputravibhavaM mitrasaMgaH subhojanam || 49||
annadAnaM priyaM nityaM dAnadharmAdisaMgrahaH |
mahArAjaprasAdena vAhanAmbarabhUShaNam || 50||
vyavasAyAtphalAdhikyaM vivAho mau~njibandhanam |
ShaShThAShTamavyaye shukre nIche shatrugR^ihe sthite || 51||
mandAraphaNisaMyukte tad.hbhuktau rogamAdishet |
akasmAtkalahaM chaiva pitR^iputraviyogakR^it || 52||
svabandhujanahAnishcha sarvatra janapIDanam |
dAyAdakalahashchaiva svaprabhoH svasya mR^ityukR^it || 53||
kalatraputrapIDA cha shUlarogAdisambhavaH |
dAyeshAtkendrarAshisthe trikoNe vA samanvite || 54||
lAbhe vA karmarAshisthe xetrapAlamahatsukham |
sugandhavastrashayyAdi gAnavAdyasukhaM bhavet || 55||
ChatrachAmarabhUShAptiH priyavastusamanvitA |
dAyeshAdripurandhrasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute || 56||
viprAhinR^ipachaurAdimUtrakR^ichChrAnmahad.hbhayam |
pramehAdraudhiro rogaH kutsitAnnaM shirovyathA || 57||
kArAgR^ihapraveshashcha rAjadaNDAddhanaxayaH |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe vA dAraputrAdinAshanam || 58||
AtmapIDA bhayaM chaiva hyapamR^ityubhayaM bhavet |
durgAlaxmIjapaM kuryAt tataHsukhamavApnuyAt || 59||
rAhorantargate sUrye svochche svaxetrakendrage |
trikoNe lAbhage vA.api tu~NgAMshe svAMshage.api vA || 60||
shubhagraheNa sandR^iShTe rAjaprItikaraM shubham |
dhanadhAnyasamR^iddhishcha hyalpamAna sukhavAham || 61||
alpagrAmAdhipatyaM cha svalpalAbho bhaviShyati |
bhAgyalagneshasaMyukte karmeshena nirIxite || 62||
rAjAshrayo mahAkIrtirvideshagamanaM tathA |
deshAdhipatyayogashcha gajashvAmbarabhUShaNam || 63||
mano.abhiShTapradAnaM cha putrakalyANasambhavam |
dayeshAdriHpharandhrasthe ShaShThe vA nIchage.api vA || 64||
jvarAtisArarogashcha kalaho rAjavigrahaH |
prayANaM shatruvR^iddhishcha nripachaurAgnipIDanam || 65||
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA dashchikye lAbhage.api vA |
videshe rAjasammAnaM kalyANaM cha shubhAvaham || 66||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu mahArogo bhaviShyati |
sUryapraNAmaM shAntiM cha kuryAdArogyasambhavAm || 67||
rAhorantargate chandre svaxetre svochchage.api vA |
kendratrikoNalAbhe vA mitrarxe shubhasaMyute || 68||
rAjatvaM rAjapUjyatvaM dhanArthaM dhanalAbhakR^it |
ArogyaM bhUShaNM chaiva mitrastrIputrasampadaH || 69||
pUrNe chandre phalaM pUrNaM rAjaprItyA shubhAvaham |
ashvavAhanalAbhaH syad.hgR^ihaxetrAdivR^iddhikR^it || 70||
dAyeshAtsukhabhAgyasthe kendre vA lAbhage.api vA |
laxmIkaTAxachihnAni gR^ihe kalyANasambhavaH || 71||
sarvakAryasiddhiH syAddhanadhAnyasukhAvahA |
satkIrtilAbhasammAnaM devyArAdhanamAcharet || 72||
dAyeshAtShaShTharandhrasthe vyaye vA balavarjite |
pishAchaxudravyAghrAdysirgR^ihaxetrArthanAshanam || 73||
mArge chaurabhayaM chaiva vraNAdhikya mahodayam |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu apamR^ityustadA bhavet || 74||
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAd viprAyArogyasiddhaye |
tataH saukhyamavApnoti chandragrahaprasAdataH || 75||
rAhorantargate bhaume lagnAllAbhatrikoNage |
kendre vA shubhasaMyukte svochche svaxetrage.api vA || 76||
naShTarAjyadhanprAptirgR^ihaxetrAbhivR^iddhikR^it |
iShTadevaprasAdena santAnasukhabhAgbhavet || 77||
xiprabhojyAnmahatsaukhyaM bhUShaNashvAmbarAdikR^it |
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA dushchikye lAbhage.api vA || 78||
raktavastrAdilAbhaH syAtprayANaM rAjadarshanam |
putravargeShu kalyANaM svaprabhoshcha mahatsukham || 79||
senapatyaM mahotsAho bhrAtR^ivargadhanAgamaH |
dAyeshAdrandhrariHphe vA ShaShThe pApasamanvite || 80||
putradArAdihAnishcha soodarANAM cha pIDanam |
sthAnabhraMsho bandhuvargadAraputravirodhanam || 81||
chaurAhivraNabhItishcha svadehasya cha pIDanam |
Adau kleshakaraM chaiva madhyAnte saukhamApnuyAt || 82||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehAlasyaM mahad.hbhayam |
anaD.hvAhaM cha gAM dadyAdArogyasukhalabdhaye || 83||
\section{atha jIvAntardashAphalAdhyAyaH || 56||}
svochche svaxetrage jIve lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
anekarAjadhIsho vA sampanno rAjapUjitaH || 1||
momahiShyAdilAbhashcha vastravAhanabhUShaNam |
nUtanasthAnanirmANaM harmyaprAkArasaMyutam || 2||
gajAntaishvaryasampattirbhAgyakarmaphalaodayaH |
brAhmaNaprabhusammAnaM samAnaM prabhudarshanam || 3||
svaprabhoH svaphalAdhikya dAraputrAdilAbhakR^it |
nIchAMshe nIcharAshisthe ShaShThAShTamavyayarAshige || 4||
nIchasa~Ngo mahAduHkhaM dAyAdajanavigrahaH |
kalaho na vichArosya svaprabhuShvapamR^ityukR^it || 5||
putradAraviyogashcha dhanadhAnyArthahAnikR^it |
saptamAdhipadoSheNa devavAdhA bhaviShyati || 6||
taddoShaparihArArthaM shivasAhasrakaM japet |
rudrajApyaM cha godAnaM kuryAt svA.abhIShTalabdhaye || 7||
jIvasyAntargate mande svochche svaxetramitrabhe |
lagnAtkendratrikoNasthe lAbhe vA balasaMyute || 8||
rAjyalAbho mahatsaukhyaM vastrAbharaNasaMyutam |
dhanadhAnyAdilAbhashcha strIlAbho bahusaukhyakR^it || 9||
vAhanAmbarapashvAdibhUlAbhaH sthAnalAbhakR^it |
putramitrAdisaukhyaM cha naravAhanayogakR^it || 10||
nIlavastrAdilAbhashcha nIlAshvaM labhate cha saH |
pashchimAM dishamAshritya prayANaM rAjadarshanam || 11||
anekayAnalAbhaM cha nirdishenmandabhuktiShu |
lagnAtShaShThAShTame mande vyaye nIche.astage.apyarau || 12||
dhanadhAnyAdinAshashcha jvarapIDA manorujaH |
strIputrAdiShu pIDA vAvraNArtyAdikamud.hbhavet || 13||
gR^ihe tvashubhakAryANi bhrtyavargAdipIDanam |
gomahiShyAdihAnishcha bandhudveShI bhaviShyati || 14||
dAyeshAtkendrakoNasthe lAbhe vA dhanage.api vA |
bhUrAbhashchArthalAbhashcha putralAbhasukhaM bhavet || 15||
gomahiShyAdilAbhashcha shUdramUlAddhanaM tathA |
dAyeshAdripurandhrasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute || 16||
dhanadhAnyAdinAshashcha bandhumitravirodhakR^it |
udyogabha~Ngo dehArtiH svajanAnAM mahad.hbhayam || 17||
dvisaptamAdhipe mande hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM viShNusAhasrakaM japet || 18||
kR^iShNAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdanenArogyamAdishet |
mandagrahaprasAdena satyaM satyaM dvijottama || 19||
jIvasyAntargate saumye kendralAbhatrikoNage |
svochche vA svarxage vApi dashAdhipasamanvite || 20||
arthalAbho dehasaukhyaM rAjyalAbho mahatsukham |
mahArAjaprasAdena sveShTasiddhiH sukhAvahA || 21||
vAhanAmbarapashvAdigodhanaissaMkulaM gR^iham |
mahIsutena saMdR^iShTe shatruvR^iddhiH sukhaxayaH || 22||
vyavasAyAtphalaM niShTaM jvarAtImArapIDanam |
dAyeshAd.hbhAgyakoNe vA kendre vA tu~NgarAshige || 23||
svadeshe dhanalAbhashcha pitR^imAtR^isukhAvahA |
gajavAjisamAyukto rAjamitraprasAdataH || 24||
dAyeshAtShaShTharandhrasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
shubhadR^iShTivihIne cha dhandhAnyaparichyutiH || 25||
videshagamanaM chaiva mArge chaurabhayaM tathA |
vraNadAhAxirogashcha nAnAdeshaparibhramaH || 26||
lagnAtShaShThAShTamabhAve vA vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
aksamAtkalahashchaiva gR^ihe miShThurabhAvaNam || 27||
chatuShpAjjIvahAnishcha vyavahAre tathaiva cha |
apamR^ityubhayaM chaiva shatrUNAM kalaho bhavet || 28||
shubhadR^iShTe shubhairyukte dArasaukhyaM dhanAgamaH |
Adau shubhaM dehasaukhyaM vAhanAmbaralAbhakR^it || 29||
ante tu dhanahAnishchetsvAtmasaukhyaM na jAyate |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe vA hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati || 30||
taddoShaparihArArthaM viShNusAhasrakaM japet |
AyurvR^iddhikaraM chaiva sarvasaubhAgyadAyakam || 31||
jIvasyAntargate ketau shubhagrahasamanvite |
alpasaukhyadhanavyAptiH kutsitAnnasya bhojanam || 32||
parAnnaM chaiva shrAddhAnnaM pApamUlAddhanAni cha |
dAyeshAdripurandhrasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute || 33||
rAjakopo dhanachChedo bandhanaM rogapIDanam |
balAhAniH pitR^idveSho bhrAtR^idveSho manorujam || 34||
dAyeshAtsutabhAgyasthe vAhane karmage.api vA |
naravAhanayogashcha gajAshvAmbarasa~N.hkulam || 35||
mahArAjaprasAdena sveShTakAryArthalAbhakR^it |
vyavasAyAtphalAdhikyaM gomahiShyAdilAbhakR^it || 36||
yavanaprabhumUlAdvA dhanavastrAdilAbhakR^it |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehavAdhA bhaviShyati || 37||
ChAgadAnaM prakurvIta mR^ityu~njayajapaM charet |
sarvadoShopashamanIM shAntiM kuryAdvidhAnataH || 38||
jIvasyAntargate shukre bhAgyakendreshasaMyute |
lAbhe vA sutarAshisthe svaxetre shubhasaMyute || 39||
naravAhanayogashcha gajAshvAmbarasaMyutaH |
mahArajaprasAdena lAbhAdhikyaM mahatsukham |
nIlAmbarANAM raktAnAM lAbhashchaiva bhaviShyati || 40||
pUrvasyAM dishi viprendra prayANaM dhanlAbhadam |
kalyANaM cha mahAprItiH pitR^imAtR^isukhAvahA || 41||
devatAgurubhaktishcha annadAnaM mahattathA |
taDAgagopurAdIni dishet puNyAni bhUrishaH || 42||
ShaShThAShTamavyaye nIche dAyeshAdvA tathaiva cha |
kalho bandhuvaiShamyaM dAraputrAdipIDanam || 43||
mandArarAhusaMyukte kalaho rAjato bhayam |
strImUlAtkalahashchaiva shvasurAtkalahastathA || 44||
sodareNa vivAdaH syAddhanadhAnyaparichyutiH |
dAyeshAtkendrarAshisthe dhane vA bhAgyage.api vA || 45||
dhanadhAnyAdilAbhashcha sr/IlAbho rAjadarshanam || 46||
vAhanaM putralAbhashcha pashuvR^iddhirmahatsukham |
gItAvAdyaprasa~NgAdirvidvajjanasamAgamaH || 47||
divyAnnabhojanaM saukhyaM svabandhujanapoShakam |
dvisaptamAdhipe shukre taddashAnAM dhanaxatiH || 48||
apamR^ityubhayaM tasya strImUlAdauShadhAditaH |
tasya rogasya shAntyarthaM shAntikarma samAcharet || 49||
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdAyurArogyavR^iddhaye |
shukragrahaprasAdena tataH sukhamavApnuyAt || 50||
jIvasyAntargate sUrye svochche svaxetrage.api vA |
kendre vA.athatrikoNe cha dushchikye lAbhage.api vA || 51||
dhane vA balasaMyute dAyeshAdvA tathaiva cha |
tatkAle dhanalAbhaH syAdrAjasammAnavaibhavam || 52||
vAhanAmbarapashvAdibhUShaNaM putrasambhavaH |
mitraprabhuvashAdiShTaM sarvakArye shubhAvaham || 53||
lagnAdaShTamavyaye sUrye dAyeshAdvA tathaiva cha |
shirorogAdipIDA cha jvarapIDA tathaiva cha || 54||
satkarmasu tadA hInaH pApakarmachayastathA |
sarvatra janavidveSho hyAtmabandhuviyogakR^it || 55||
akasmAtkalahashchaiva jIvasyAntargate ravau |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehapIDA bhaviShyati || 56||
taddoShaparihArArthamAdityahR^idayaM japet |
sarvapIDopashamanaM shrIsUryasya prasAdataH || 57||
jIvasyAntargate chandre kendre lAbhatrikoNage |
svochche vA svarxarAshisthe pUrNe chaiva balairyute || 58||
dAyeshAchChubharAshisthe rAjasammAnavaibhavam |
dAraputrAdisaukhyaM cha xIrANaM bhojanaM tathA || 59||
satkarma cha tathA kIrtiH putrapautrAdivR^iddhidA |
mahArAjaprasAdena sarvasaukhyaM dhanAgamaH || 60||
anekajanasaukhyaM cha dAnadharmAdisaMgrahaH |
ShaShThAShTamavyaye chandre sthite vA pApasaMyute || 61||
dAyeshAtShaShTharandhre vA vyaye vA balavarjite |
mAnArthabandhuhAnishcha videshaparivichyutiH || 62||
nR^ipachaurAdipIDA cha dAyAdajanavigrahaH |
mAtulAdiviyogashcha mAtR^ipIDA tathaiva cha || 63||
dvitIyaShaShThayorIshe dehapIDA bhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM durgApAThaM cha kArayet || 64||
jIvasyAntargate bhaume lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svochche vA svarxage vApi tu~NgAMshe svAMshage.api vA || 65||
vidyAvivAhakAryANi grAmabhUmyAdilAbhakR^it |
janasAmarthyamApnoti sarvakAryArthasiddhidam || 66||
dAyeshAtkendrakoNasthe lAbhe vA dhanage.api vA |
shubhayukte shubhairdR^iShTe dhanadhAnyAdisampadaH || 67||
miShThAnnadAnavibhavaM rAjaprItikaraM shubham |
strIsaukhyaM cha sutavAptiH puNyatIrthaphalaM tathA || 68||
dAyeshAdrandhrabhAve vA vyaye vA nIchage.api vA |
pApayutexite vApi dhAnyArthagR^ihanAshanam || 69||
nAnarogabhayaM duHkhaM netrarogAdisambhavaH |
pUrvArddhe kaShTamadhikamaparArddhe mahatsukham || 70||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehajADyaM manorujaH |
vR^iShabhasya pradAnaM tu sarvasampatpradAyakam || 71||
jIvasyAntargate rAhau svochche vA kendrage.api vA |
mUlatrikoNe bhAgye cha kendrAdhipasamanvite || 72||
shubhayutexite vApi yogaprItiM samAdishet |
bhuktyAdau pa~nchamAsAMshcha dhanadhAnyAdikaM labhet || 73||
deshagrAmAdhikaM cha yavanaprabhudarshanam |
gR^ihe kalyANasampattirbahusenAdhipatyakam || 74||
dUrayAtrAdigamanaM puNyadharmAdisaMgrahaH |
setusnAnaphalAvAptiriShTasiddhiH sukhAvahA || 75||
dAyeShAdrandhrabhAve vA vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
chaurAhivraNabhItishcha rAjavaiShamyameva cha || 76||
gR^ihe karmakalApena vyAkulo bhavati dhruvam |
sodareNa virodhaH syAddAyAdajanavigrahaH || 77||
gR^ihe tvashubhakAryANi duHsvapnAdibhayaM dhruvam |
akasmAtkalahashchaiva xUdrashUnyAdirogakR^it || 78||
dvisaptamasthite rAhau dehavAdhAM vinirdishet |
taddoShaparihArArthaM mR^ityu~njayajapaM charet || 79||
ChAgadAnaM prakurvIta sarvasaukhyamavApnuyAt |
devapUyaprasAdena rAhutuShT.hyA dvijottama || 80||
\section{atha shanyantardashAphalAdhyAyaH || 57||}
mUlatrikoNe svarxe vA tulAyAmuchchage.api vA |
kendratrikoNalAbhe vA rAjayogAdisaMyute || 1||
rAjyalAbho mahatsaukhyaM dAraputrAdivardhanam |
vAhanatrayasaMyuktaM gajAshvAmbarasa~N.hkulam || 2||
mahArAjaprasAdena senApatyAdilAbhakR^it |
chatuShpAjjIvalAbhaH syAd.hgrAmabhUmyAdilAbhakR^it || 3||
tathA.aShTame vyaye mande nIche vA pApasaMyute |
tad.hbhuktyAdau rAjabhItirviShashastrAdipIDanam || 4||
raktastrAvo gulmarogo hyatimArAdipIDanam |
madhye chaurAdi bhItishcha deshatyAgo manorujaH || 5||
ante shubhakarI chaiva shanerantardashA dvija |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati || 6||
taddoShaparihArArthaM mrTyu~njayajapaM charet |
tataH shAntimavApnoti sha~Nkarasya prasAdataH || 7||
mandasyAntargate saumye trikoNe kendrage.api vA |
sammAnaM cha yashaH kIrtiM vidyAlAbhaM dhanAgamam || 8||
svadeshe sukhamApnoti vAhanAdiphalairyutam |
yaj~nAdikarmasiddhishcha rAjayogAdisambhavam || 9||
dehasaukhyaM hR^idutsAhaM gR^ihe kalyANasambhavam |
setusnAnaphalAvAptistIrthayAtrAdikarmaNA || 10||
vANijyAddhanalAbhashcha purANashravaNAdikam |
annadAnaphalaM chaiva nityaM miShThAnnabhojanam || 11||
ShaShThAShTamavyaye saumye nIche vAstaMgate sati |
ravyAraphaNisaMyukte dAyeshAdvA tathaiva cha || 12||
nR^ipAbhiShekamarthAptirdeshagrAmAdhipatyatA |
phalamIdR^ishamAdau tu madhyAnte rogapIDanam || 13||
naShTAni sarvakAryANi vyAkulatvaM mahad.hbhayam |
dvitIyasaptamAdhishe dehabAdhA bhaviShyati || 14||
taddoShaparihArArthaM viShNusAhasrakaM japet |
annadAnaM prakurvIta sarvasampatpradAyakam || 15||
mandasyAntargate ketau shubhadR^iShTiyutexite |
svochche vA shubharAshisthe yogakArakasaMyute || 16||
kendrakoNagate vApi sthAnabhraMsho mahad.hbhayam |
daridrabandhanaM bhItiH putradArAdinAshanam || 17||
svaprabhoshcha mahAkaShTaM videshagamanaM tathA |
lagnAdhipena saMyukte Adau saukhyaM dhanAgamaH || 18||
ga~NgAdisarvatIrbheShu snAnaM daivatadarshanam |
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA tR^itIyabhavarAshige || 19||
samartho dharmabuddhishcha saukhyaM nR^ipasamAgamaH |
tathA.aShTame vyaye ketau dAyeshAdvA tathaiva cha || 20||
apamR^ityubhayaM chaiva kutsitAnnasya bhojanam |
shItajvarAtisArashcha vraNachaurAdipIDanam || 21||
dAraputraviyogashcha saMsAre bhavati dhruvam |
dvitiyadyUnarAshisthe deha pIDA bhaviShyati || 22||
ChAgadAnaM prakurvIta hyapamR^ityunivAraNam |
ketugrahaprasAdena sukhashAntimavApnuyAt || 23||
mandasyAntargate shukre svochche svaxetrage.api vA |
kendre vA shubhasaMyukte triokoNe lAbhage.api vA || 24||
dAraputradhanaprAptirdehArogyaM mahotsavaH |
gR^ihe kalyANsampatti rAjyalAbhaM mahatsukham || 25||
mahArAjaprasAdena hIShTasiddhiH sukhAvahA |
ssammAnaM prabhusammAnaM priyavastrAdilAbhakR^it || 26||
dvipAntarAdvastralAbhaH shvetAshvo mahiShI tathA |
guruchAravashAd.hbhAgyaM saukhyaM cha dhanasampadaH || 27||
shanichArAnmanuShyo.asau yogamApnotyasaMshayam |
shatrunIchAstage shukre ShaShThAShTamavyayarAshige || 28||
dAranAsho manaHkleshaH sthAnanAsho manorujaH |
dArAnAM svajanakleshaH santApo janavigrahaH || 29||
dAyeshAd.hbhAgyage chaiva kendre vA lAbhasaMyute |
rAjaprItikaraM chaiva mano.abhIShTapradAyakam || 30||
dAnadharmadayAyuktaM tIrthayAtrAdikaM phalam |
sAsrtArthakAvyarachanAM vedAntashravaNAdikam || 31||
dAraputrAdisaukhyaM cha labhate nA.atra saMshayaH |
dAyeshAdvyayage shukre ShaShThe vA hyaShTame.api vA || 32||
netrapIDA jvarabhayaM svakulAchAravarjitaH |
kapole dantashUlAdi hR^idi guhye cha pIDanam || 33||
jalabhItirmanastApo vR^ixAtpatanasambhavaH |
rAjadvAre janadveShaH sodhareNa virodhanam || 34||
dvitIyasaptamAdhIshe Atmaklesho bhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM durgAdevIjapaM charet || 35||
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdAyurArogyavR^iddhidAm |
jagadambAprasAdena tataH sukhamavApnuyAt || 36||
mandasyAntargate sUrye svochche svaxetrage.api vA |
bhAgyAdhipena saMyukte kendralAbhatrikoNage || 37||
shubhadR^iShTiyute vApi svaprabhoshcha mahatsukham |
gR^ihe kalyANasampattiH putrAdisukhavarddhanam || 38||
vAhanAmbarapashvAdigoxIraissaMkulaM gR^iham |
lagnAShTamavyaye sUrye dAyeshAdvA tathaiva cha || 39||
hR^idrogo mAnahAnishcha sthAnabhraMsho manorujA |
iShTbandhuviyogashcha udyogasya vinAshanam || 40||
tApajvarAdipIDA cha vyAkulatvaM bhayaM tathA |
AtmasambandhimaraNamiShTavastuviyogakR^it || 41||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehabAdhA bhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM sUryapUjAM cha kArayet || 42||
mandasyAntargate chandre jIvadR^iShTisamanvite |
svochche svaxetrakendrasthe trikoNe lAbhage.api vA || 43||
pUrNe shubhagrahairyukte rAjaprItisamAgamaH |
mahArAjaprasAdena vAhanAmbarabhUShaNam || 44||
saubhAgyaM sukhavR^iddhiM cha bhR^ityAnAM paripAlanam |
pitR^imAtR^ikule saukhyaM pashuvR^iddhiH sukhAvahA || 45||
xINe vA pApasaMyukte pApadR^iShTe vA nIchage |
krUrAMshakagate vApi krUraxetragate.api vA || 46||
jAtakasya mahatkaShTaM rAjakopo dhanaxayaH |
pitR^imAtR^iviyogashcha putrIputrAdirogakR^it || 47||
vyavasAyAtphalaM neShTaM nAnAmArge dhanavyayaH |
akAle bhojanaM chaiva mauShadhasya cha bhaxaNam || 48||
phalametadvijAnIyAdAdau saukhyaM dhanAgamaH |
dAyeshAtkendrarAshisthe trikoNe lAbhage.api vA || 49||
vAhanAmbarapashvAdibhrAtR^ivR^iddhiH sukhAvahA |
pitR^imAtR^isukhAvAptiH strIsaukhyaM cha dhanAgamaH || 50||
mitraprabhuvashAdiShTaM sarvasaukhyaM shubhAvaham |
dAyeshAd.hdvAdasha bhAve randhre vA balavarjite || 51||
shayanaM rogamAlasyaM sthAnabhraShTaM sukhApaham |
shatruvR^iddhivirodhaM cha bandhudveShamavApnuyAt || 52||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehAlasya bhaviShyati |
taddoShashamanArthaM cha tilahomAdikaM charet || 53||
guDaM ghR^itaM cha dadhnAktaM taNDulaM cha yathAvidhi |
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdAyurArogyavR^iddhaye || 54||
mandasyAntargate bhaume kendralAbhatrikoNage |
tu~Nge svaxetrage vApi dashAdhipasamanvite || 55||
lagnAdhipena saMyukte Adau saukhyaM dhanAgamaH |
rAjaprItikaraM saukhyaM vAhanAmbarabhUShaNam || 56||
senApatyaM nR^ipaprItiH kR^iShigodhAnyasampadaH |
nUtanasthAnanirmANaM bhrAtR^ivargeShTasaukhyakR^it || 57||
nIche chAsta~Ngate bhaume lagnAdaShTavyayasthite |
pApadR^iShTiyute vApi dhanahAnirbhaviShyati || 58||
chaurAhivraNashastrAdigranthirogAdipIDanam |
bhrAtR^ipitrAdipIDA cha dAyAdajanavigrahaH || 59||
chatuShpAjjIvahAnishcha kutsitAnnasya bhojanam |
videshagamanaM chaiva nAnamArge dhanavyayaH || 60||
aShTamadyUnanAthe tu dvitIyasthe.atha vA yadi |
apamR^ityubhayaM chaiva nAnAkaShTaM parAbhavaH || 61||
taddoShaparihArArthaM shAntihomaM cha kArayet |
vR^iShadAnaM prakurvIta sarvAriShTanivAraNam || 62||
mandasyAntargate rAhau kalahashcha manovyathA |
dehapIDA manastApaH putradveSho rujobhayam || 63||
arthavyayo rAjabhayaM svajanAdivirodhitA |
videshagamanaM chaiva gR^ihaxetrAdinAshanam || 64||
lagnAdhipena saMyukte yogakArakasaMyute |
svochche svaxetrage kendre dAyeshAllAbharAshige || 65||
Adau saukhyaM dhanAvAptiM gR^ihaxetrAdisampadam |
devabrAhmaNabhaktiM cha tIrthayAtrAdikaM labhet || 66||
chatuShpAjjIvalAbhaH syAd.hgR^ihe kalyANvarddhanam |
madhye tu rAjabhItishcha putramitravirodhanam || 67||
meShe kanyAgate vApi kulIre vR^iShabhe tathA |
mInakodaNDasiMheShu gajAntaishvaryamAdishet || 68||
rAjasammanabhUShAptiM mR^idulAbharasaukhyakR^it |
dvisaptamAdhipairyukte dehabAdhA bhaviShyati || 69||
mR^ityu~njayaM prakurvIta ChAgadAnaM cha kArayet |
vR^iShadAnaM prakurvIta sarvasampatsukhAvaham || 70||
mandasyAntargate jIve kendre lAbhatrikoNage |
lagnAdhipena saMyukte svochche svaxetrage.api vA || 71||
sarvakAryArthasiddhiH syAchChobhanaM bhavati dhruvam |
mahArAjaprasAdena dhanavAhanabhUShaNam || 72||
sanmAnaM prabhusammAnaM priyavastrArthalAbhakR^it |
devatAgurubhaktishcha vidvajjanasamAgamaH || 73||
dAraputrAdilAbhashcha putrakalyANavaibhavam |
ShaShThAShTamavyaye jIve nIche vA pApasaMyute || 74||
nijasambandhimaraNaM dhanadhAnyavinAshanam |
rAjasthAne janadveShaH karyahAnirbhaviShyati || 75||
videshagamanaM chaiva kuShTharogAdisambhavaH |
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA dhane vA lAbhage.api vA || 76||
vibhavaM dArasaubhAgyaM rAjashrIdhanasampadaH |
bhojanAmbarasaukhyaM cha dAnadharmAdikaM bhavet || 77||
brahmaprtiShThAsiddhishcha kratukarmaphalaM tathA |
annadAnaM mahAkIrtirvedAntashravaNAdikam || 78||
dAyeshAtShaShTharandhre vA vyaye vA balavarjite |
bandhudveSho manoduHkhaM kalahaH padavichyuti || 79||
kubhojanaM karmahAnI rAjadaNDAddhanavyaya |
kArAgR^ihapraveshashcha putradArAdipIDanam || 80||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehavAdhA manorujaH |
AtmasambandhamaraNaM bhaviShyati na saMshayaH || 81||
taddoShaparihArArthaM shivasAhasrakaM japet |
svarNadAnaM prkurvIta hyArogyaM bhavati dhruvam || 82||
\section{atha budhAntardashAphalAdhyAyaH || 58||}
muktAvidrumalAbhashcha j~nAnakarmasukhAdikam |
vidyAmahattvaM kIrtishcha nUtanaprabhudarshanam || 1||
vibhavaM dAraputrAdi pitR^imAtR^isukhAvaham |
svochchAdisthe.atha nIche.aste ShaShThAShTamavyayarAshige || 2||
pApayukte.athavA dR^iShTe dhanadhAnyapashuxayaH |
Atmabandhuvirodhashcha shUlaroogAdisambhavaH || 3||
rAjakAryakalApena vyAkulo bhavti dhruvam |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dAraklesho bhaviShyati || 4||
AtmasambandhimaraNaM vAtashUlAdisambhavaH |
taddoShaparihArArthaM viShNusAhasrakaM japet || 5||
budhasyAntargate ketau lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
shubhayukte shubhairdR^iShTe lagnAdhipasamanvite || 6||
yogakArakasambandhe dAyeshAtkendralAbhage |
dehasaukhyaM dhanAlpatvaM bandhusnehamathAdishet || 7||
chatuShpAjjIvalAbhaH syAtsaMchAreNa dhanAgamaH |
vidyAkIrtirprasa~Ngashcha samAnaprabhudarshanam || 8||
bhojanAmbarasaukhyaM cha hyAdau madhye sukhAvaham |
dAyeshAdyadi randhrasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute || 9||
vAhanAtpatanaM chaiva putrakleshAdisambhavaH |
chaurAdirAjabhItishcha pApakarmarataH sadA || 10||
vR^ishchikAdiviShAd.hbhItirnIchaiH kalahasaMbhavaH |
shokarogAdiduHkhaM cha nIchasa~NgAdikaM bhavet || 11||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehajADyaM bhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArAya ChAgadAnaM tu kArayet || 12||
saumyasyAntargate shukre kendre lAbhe trikoNage |
satkathApuNyadharmAdisaMgrahaH puNyakarmakR^it || 13||
mitraprabhuvashAdiShTaM xetralAbhaH sukhaM bhavet |
dashAdhipAtkendragate trikoNe lAbhage.api vA || 14||
tatkAle shriyamApnoti rAjashrIdhanasampadaH |
vApIkUpataDAgadidAnadharmAdisaMgrahaH || 15||
vyavasAyAtphalAdhikyaM dhanadhAnyasamR^iddhikR^it |
dAyeshAtShaShTharandhrasthe vyaye vA balavarjite || 16||
hR^idrogo mAnahAnishcha jvarAtIsArapIDanam |
Atmabandhuviyogashcha saMsAre bhavati dhruvam || 17||
AtmakaShTaM manastApadAyakaM dvijasattama |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati || 18||
taddoShaparihArArthaM durgAdevIjapaM charet |
jagadambAprasAdena tataH shAntimavApnuyAt || 19||
saumyasyAntargate sUrye svochche svaxetrakendrage |
trikoNe dhanalAbhe tu tu~NgAMshe svAMshage.api vA || 20||
rAjaprasAdasubhAgyaM mitraprabhuvashAtsukham |
bhUmyAtmajena saMdR^iShTe Adau bhUlAbhamAdishet || 21||
lagnAdhipena saMdR^iShTe bahusaukhyaM dhanAgamam |
grAmabhUmyAdilAbhaM cha bhojanAmbarasaukhyakR^it || 22||
lagnAShTamavyaye vApi shanyAraphaNisaMyute |
dAyeshAdripurandhrasthe vyaye vA balavarjite || 23||
chaurAdishastrapIDA cha pittAdhikyaM bhaviShyati |
shiroru~NmanasastApa iShTabandhuviyogakR^it || 24||
dvitIyasaptamAdhIshe hyapamR^ityurbhavishyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM shAntiM kuryAdyathAvidhi || 25||
saumyasyAntargate chandre lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svochche vA svarxage vApi gurudR^iShTisamanvite || 26||
yogasthAnAdhipatyena yogaprAbalyamAdishet |
strIlAbhaM putralAbhaM cha vastravAhanabhUShaNam || 27||
nUtanAlayalAbhaM cha nityaM miShThAnnabhojanam |
gItavAdyaprasaMgaM cha shAstravidyAparishramam || 28||
daxiNAM dishamAshritya prayANaM cha bhaviShyati |
dvIpAntarAdivastrANAM lAbhashchaiva bhaviShyati || 29||
muktAvidrumaratnAni dhautavastrAdikaM labhet |
nIchArixetrasaMyukte dehabAdhA bhaviShyati || 30||
dAyeshAtkendrakoNasthe dushchikye lAbhage.api vA |
tad.hbhuktyAdau puNyatIrthasthAnadaivatadarshanam || 31||
manodhairyaM hR^idutsAho videshadhanalAbhakR^it |
dAyeshAtShaShTharandhre vA vyaye vA pApasaMyute || 32||
chorAgninR^ipabhItishcha strIsamAgamato bhavet |
duShkR^itirdhanahAnishcha kR^iShigoshvAdinAshakR^it || 33||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehabAdhA bhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM durgAdevIjapaM charet || 34||
vastradAnaM prakurvIta AyurvR^iddhisukhAvaham |
jagadambAprasAdena tataH sukhamavApnuyAt || 35||
saumyasyAntargate bhaume lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svochche vA svarxage vApi lagnAdhipasamanvite || 36||
rAjAnugrahashAntiM cha gR^ihe kalyANasambhavam |
laxmIkaTAxachihnAni naShTarAjyArthamApnuyAt || 37||
putrotsavAdisantoShaM gR^ihe godhanasaMkulam |
gR^ihaxetrAdilAbhaM cha gajavAjisamanvitam || 38||
rAjaprItikaraM chaiva strIsaukhyaM chAtishobhanam |
nIchaxetrasamAyukte hyaShTame vA vyaye.api vA || 39||
pApadR^iShTiyute vApi dehapIDA manovyathA |
udyogabha~Ngo dashAdau svagrAme dhAnyanashanam || 40||
graMthishastravraNAdInAM bhayaM tApajvarAdikam |
dAyeshAtkendrage bhaume trikoNe lAbhage.api vA || 41||
shubhadR^iShTe dhanaprAptirdehasaukhyaM bhavenR^iNAm |
putralAbho yashovR^iddhirbhrAtR^ivargo mahApriyaH || 42||
dAyeshAdatha randhrasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
tad.hbhuktyAdau mahAklesho bhrAtR^ivarge mahad.hbhayam || 43||
nR^ipAgnichaurabhItishcha putramitravirodhanam |
sthAnabhraMsho bhavedAdau madhye saukhyaM dhanAgamaH || 44||
ante tu rAjabhItiH syAtsthAnabhraMshohyathApivA |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu hyapamR^ityubhayaM bhavet || 45||
godAnaM cha prakurvIta mR^ityu~njayajapaM charet |
sha~Nkarasya prasAdena tataH sukahmavApnuyAt || 46||
budhasyAntargate rAhau kendralAbhatrikoNage |
kulIre kumbhage vApi kanyAyAM vR^iShabhepi vA || 47||
rAjasammAnakIrtiM cha dhanaM cha prabhaviShyati |
puNyatIrthasthAnalAbho devatAdarshanaM tathA || 48||
iShtApUrte cha mahato mAnashchAmbaralAbhakR^it |
bhuktyAdau dehapIDA cha tvante saukhyaM vinirdishet || 49||
lagnAShTavyayarAshisthe tad.hbhuktau dhananAshanam |
bhuktyAdau dehanAshashcha vAtajvaramajIrNakR^it || 50||
lagnAdupachaye rAhau shubhagrahasamanvite |
rAjasaMlApasantoSho nUtanaprabhudarshanam || 51||
dAyeshAd.hdvAdashe vApi hyaShTame pApasaMyute |
niShThuraM rAjakAryANi sthAnabhraMsho mahad.hbhayam || 52||
bandhanaM rogapIDA cha nijabandhumanovyathA |
hR^idrogo mAnahAnishcha dhanahAnirbhaviShyati || 53||
dvitIyasaptamasthe vA hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM durgAlaxmIjapaM charet || 54||
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdAyuArogyadAyinIm |
jagadambAprasAdena tataH sukhamavApnuyAt || 55||
budhasyAntargate jIve lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svochche vA svarxage vApi lAbhe vA dhanarAshige || 56||
dehasaukhyaM dhanAvAptI rAjaprItistathaiva cha |
vivAhotsavakAryANi nityaM miShThAnnabhojanam || 57||
gomahiShyAdilAbhashcha purANasr/avaNAdikam |
devatAgurubhaktishcha dAnadharmamakhAdikam || 58||
yaj~nakarmapravR^iddhishcha shivapUjAphalaM tathA |
nIche vAstaMgate vApi ShaShThAShTavyayage.api vA || 59||
shanyAradR^iShTasaMyukte kalaho rAjavigrahaH |
chaurAdidehapIDA cha pitR^imAtR^ivinAshnam || 60||
mAnahAni rAjadaNDo dhanahAnirbhaviShyati |
viShAhijvarapIDA cha kR^iShibhUmivinAshanam || 61||
dayeshAtkendrakoNe vA lAbhe vA balasaMyute |
bandhuputrahR^idutsAho shubhaM cha dhanasaMyutam || 62||
pashuvR^iddhiryashovR^iddhirannadAnAdikaM phalam |
dAyeshAtShaShTharandhre vA vyaye vA balavarjite || 63||
a~NgatApashcha vaikalyaM dehabAdhA bhviShyati |
kalatrabandhuvaiShamyaM rAjakopo dhanaxayaH || 64||
akasmAtkalahAd.hbhItiH pramAdo dvijato bhayam |
dvitIyasaptamasthe vA dehabAdhA bhaviShyati || 65||
taddoShaparihArArthaM shivasAhasrakaM japet |
gobhUriraNyadAnena sarvAriShTaM vyapohati || 66||
saumyasyAntargate mande svochche svaxetrakendrage |
trikoNalAbhage vApi gR^ihe kalyANavarddhanam || 67||
rAjyalAbhaM mahotsAhaM gR^ihaM godhanasaMkulam || 68||
shubhasthAnaphalavAptiM tIrthavAsaM tathAdishet |
aShTame vA vyaye mande dAyeshAdvA tathaiva cha || 69||
arAtiduHkhabAhulyaM dAraputrAdipIDanam |
buddhibhraMsho bandhunAshaH karmanAsho manorujaH || 70||
videshagamanaM chaiva duHsvapnAdipradarshanam |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati || 71||
taddoShaparihArArthaM mR^ityu~njayajapaM charet |
kR^iShNAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdAyurArogyavR^iddhaye || 72||
\section{atha ketvantardashAphalAdhyAyaH || 59||}
kendre trikoNalAbhe vA ketau lagneshasaMyute |
bhAgyakarmasusambandhe vAhaneshasamanvite || 1||
tad.hbhuktau dhanadhAnyAdi chatuShpAjjIvalAbhakR^it |
putradArAdisaukhyaM cha rAjaprItimanorujaH || 2||
grAmabhUmyAdilAbhashcha gR^ihaM godhanasaMkulam |
nIchAstakheTasaMyukte hyaShTame vyayage.api vA || 3||
hR^idrogo mAnahAnishcha dhanadhAnyapashuxayaH |
dAraputrAdipIDA cha manashchAMchalyameva cha || 4||
dvitIyadyUnanAthena sambandhe tatra saMsthite |
anArogyaM mahatkaShTamAtmabandhuviyogakR^it || 5||
durgAdevIjapaM kuryAnmR^ityu~njayajapaM charet |
evaM svAntargate ketau tataH sukhamavApnuyAt || 6||
ketorantargate shukre svochche svakShetrasaMyute |
kendratrikoNalAbhe vA rAjyanAthena saMyute || 7||
rAjaprItiM cha saubhAgyaM dishAtsvAmbarasaMkulam |
tatkAle shriyamApnoti bhAgyakarmeshasaMyute || 8||
naShTarAjyadhanaprAptiM sukhavAhanasuttamam |
setusnAnAdikaM chaiva devatAdarshanaM mahat || 9||
mahArAjaprasAdena grAmabhUmyAdilAbhakR^it |
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA dushchikye lAbhage.api vA || 10||
dehArogyaM shubhaM chaiva gR^ihe kalyANashobhanam |
bhojanAmbarabhUShAptirathadolAdilAbhakR^it || 11||
dAyeshAdripurandhrasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
akasmAtkalahaM chaiva pashudhAnyAdipIDanam || 12||
nIchasthe kheTasaMyukte lagnAtShaShThAShTarAshige |
svabandhujanavaiShamyaM shiroxivraNapIDanam || 13||
hR^idrogaM mAnahAniM cha dhanadhAnyapashuxayam |
kalatraputrapIDAyAH sa~nchAraM cha samAdishet || 14||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehajADyaM manorujam |
taddoShaparihArArthaM durgAdevIjapaM charet |
shvetAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdAyuArogyavR^iddhaye || 15||
ketorantargate sUrye svochche svaxetrage.api vA |
kendratrikoNalAbhe vA shubhayuktanirIxite || 16||
dhanadhAnyAdilAbhashcha rAjAnugrahavaibhavam |
anekashubhakAryANi cheShTasiddhiH sukhAvahA || 17||
aShTamavyayarAshisthe pApagrahasamanvite |
tad.hbhuktau rAjabhItishcha pitR^imAtR^iviyogakR^it || 18||
videshagamanaM chaiva chaurAhiviShapIDanam |
rAjamitravirodhashcha rAjadaNDAddhanaxayaH || 19||
shokarogabhayaM chaiva uShNAdhikyaM jvaro bhavet |
dAyeshAtlendrakoNe vA lAbhe vA dhanasaMsthite || 20||
dehasaukhyaM chArthalAbha0 putralAbho manodR^iDham |
sarvakAryArthasiddhiH syAtsvalpagrAmAdhipatyayuk || 21||
dAyeshAdrandhrariHphe vA sthite vA pApasaMyute |
annavighno manobItirdhanadhAnyapashuxayaH || 22||
Adau madhye mahAkleshAnante saukhyaM vinirdishet |
dvitIyasaptamAdhIshe hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati || 23||
tasya shAntiM prakurvIta svarNaM dhenuM pradApayet |
bhAskarasya prasAdena tataH sukhamavApnuyAt || 24||
ketorantargate chandre svochche svaxetrage.api vA |
kendratrikoNalAbhe vA dhane shubhasamanvite || 25||
rAjaprItirmahotsAhaH kalyANaM cha mahatsukham |
mahArAjaprasAdena gR^ihabhUmyAdilAbhakR^it || 26||
bhojanAmbarapashvAdivyavasAye.adhikaM phalam |
ashvavAhanalAbhashcha vastrabharaNabhUShaNam || 27||
devAlayataDAgAdipuNyadharmAdisa~N.hgraham |
putradArAdisaukhyaM cha pUrNachandraH prayachChati || 28||
xINe vA nIchage chandre ShaShThAShTamavyayarAshige |
AtmasaukhyaM manastApaM kAryavighnaM mahad.hbhayam || 29||
pitR^imAtR^iviyogaM cha dehajADyaM manovyathAm |
vyavasAyAtphalaM kaShTaM pashunAshaM bhayaM vadet || 30||
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA lAbhe vA balasaMyute |
kR^iShigobhUmilAbhaM cha iShTabandhusamAgamam || 31||
tasmAtsvakAryasiddhiM cha gR^ihe goxIrameva cha |
bhuktyAdau shubhamArogyaM madhye rAjapriyaM shubham || 32||
ante tu rAjabhItiM cha videshagamanaM tathA |
dUrayAtrAdisa~nchAraM sambandhijanapUjanam || 33||
dAyeshAtShaShThariHphe vA randhre vA balavarjite |
dhanadhAnyAdihAnishcha manovyAtkulameva cha || 34||
svabandhujanavairaM cha bhrAtR^ipIDA tathaiva cha |
nidhanAdhipadoSheNa dvisaptapatisaMyute || 35||
apamR^ityubhayaM tasya shAntiM kuryAdyathAvidhi |
chandraprItikarIM chaiva hyAyurArogyasiddhaye || 36||
ketorantargate bhaume lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svochche svaxetrage vA.api shubhagrahayutexite || 37||
Adau shubhaphalaM chaiva grAmabhUmyAdilAbhakR^it |
dhanadhAnyAdilAbhashcha chatuShpAjjIvalAbhakR^it || 38||
gR^igArAmaxetralAbho rAjAnugrahavaibhavam |
bhAgye karmeshasambandhe bhUlAbhaH saukhyameva cha || 39||
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA dushchikye lAbhage.api vA |
rAjaprItiyasholAbhaH putramitrAdisaukhyakR^it || 40||
tathA.aShTamavyaye bhaume dAyeshAddhanage.api vA |
drutaM karoti maraNaM videshe chApadaM bhramam || 41||
pramehamUtrakR^ichChrAdichaurAdinR^ipapIDanam |
kalahAdi vyathAyuktaM ki~nchitsukhavivarddhanam || 42||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu tApajvaraviShAd.hbhayam |
dArapIDA manaHkleshamapamR^ityubhayaM bhavet || 43||
aND.hvAhaM pradadyAttu sarvasampatsukhAvaham |
tataH shAntimavApnoti bhaumagrahaprasAdataH || 44||
ketorantargate rAhau svochche mitrasvarAshige |
kendratrikoNe lAbhe vA dushchikye dhanasaMj~nake || 45||
tatkAle dhanalAbhaH syAtsa~nchAro bhavati dhruvam |
mlechChaprabhuvashAtsaukhyaM dhandhAnyaphalAdikam || 46||
chatuShpAjjIvalAbhaH syAd.hgrAmabhUmyAdilAbhakR^it |
bhuktyAdau kleshamApnoti madhyAnte saukhyamApnuyAt || 47||
randhre vA vyayage rAhau pApasaMdR^iShTasaMyute |
bahumUtraM kR^ishaM deehaM shItajvaraviShAd.hbhayam || 48||
chAturthikajvaraM chaiva xudropadravapIDanam |
akasmAtkalahaM chaiva pramehaM shUlamAdishet || 49||
dvitIyasaptamasthe vA tadA kleshaM mahad.hbhayam |
taddoShaparihArArthaM durgAdevIjapaM charet || 50||
ketorantargate jIve kandre lAbhe trikoNage |
svochche svaxetrage vApi lagnAdhipasamanvite || 51||
karmabhAgyAdhipairyukte dhanadhAnyArthasampadam |
rAjaprItiM tadotsAhamashvAMdolyAdikaM dishet || 52||
gR^ihe kalyANasampattiM putralAbhaM mahotsavaham |
puNyatIrthaM mahotsAhaM satkarma cha sukhAvaham || 53||
iShTadevaprasAdena vijayaM kAryalAbhakR^it |
rAjasaMllApakAryANi nUtanaprabhudarshanam || 54||
ShaShThAShTamavyaye jIve dAyeshAnnIchage.api vA |
chaurAhivraNabhItiM cha dhanadhAnyAdinAshanam || 55||
putradArAviyogaM cha tvatIvakleshasambhavam |
Adau subhaphalaM chaiva ante kleshakaraM vadet || 56||
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA dushchikye lAbhage.api vA |
shubhayukte nR^ipaprItirvichitrAmbarabhUShaNam || 57||
dUradeshaprayANaM cha svabandhujanapoShaNam |
bhojanAmbarapashvAdi bhuktyAdau dehapIDanam || 58||
ante tu sthAnachalanamakasmAtkalaho bhavet |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati || 59||
taddoShaparihArArthaM shivasAhasrakaM japet |
mahAmR^ityu~njayaM jApyaM sarvopadravanAshanam || 60||
ketorantargate mande svadashAyAM tu pIDanam |
bandhoH klesho manastApashchatuShpAjjIvalAbhakR^it || 61||
rAjakAryakalApena dhananAsho mahad.hbhayam |
sthAnAchchyutiH pravAsashcha mArge chaurabhayaM bhavet || 62||
AlasyaM manaso hAnishchAShTame vyayarAshige |
mInatrikoNage mande tulAyAM svarxage.api vA || 63||
kendratrikoNalAbhe vA dushchikye vA shubhAMshake |
shubhadR^iShTayute chaiva sarvakAryArthasAdhanam || 64||
svaprabhoshcha mahatsaukhyaM bhramaNaM cha sukhAvaham |
svagrAme sukhasampattiH svavarge rAjadarshanam || 65||
dAyeshAtShaShThariHphe vA aShTame pApasaMyute |
dehatApo manastApaH kArye vighno mahad.hbhayam || 66||
AlasyaM mAnahAnishcha pitR^imAtrorvinAshanam |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu hyapamR^ityubhayaM bhavet || 67||
taddoShapairhArArthaM tilahomaM cha kArayet |
kR^iShNAM gAM mahiShIM dadyAdAyurArogyavR^iddhaye || 68||
ketorantargate saumye kendralAbhatrikoNage |
svochche svaxetrasaMyukte rAjyalAbho mahatsukham || 69||
satkathAshravaNaM dAnaM dharmasiddhiH sukhAvahA |
bhUlAbhaH putralAbhashcha shubhagoShThIdhanAgamaH || 70||
ayatnAddharmalabdhishcha vivAhashcha bhaviShyati |
gR^ihe shubhakaraM karma vastrAbharaNabhUShaNam || 71||
bhAgyakarmAdhipairyukte bhAgyavR^iddhiH sukhAvahA |
vidvad.hgoShThIkathAbhishcha kAlaxepo bhaviShyati || 72||
ShaShThAShTamavyaye saumye mandArAhiyutexite |
virodho rAjavargaishcha paragehanivAsanam || 73||
vAhanAmbarapashvAdidhanadhAnyAdinAshakR^it |
bhuktyAdau shobhanaM proktaM madhye saukhyaM dhanAgamaH || 74||
ante kleshakaraM chaiva dAraputrAdipIDanam |
dAyeshAtkendrage saumye trikoNe lAbhage.api vA || 75||
dehArogyaM mahAMllAbhaH putrakalyANavaibhavam |
bhojanAmbarapashvAdivyavasAye.adhikaM phalam || 76||
dAyeshAtShaShTharandhre vA vyaye vA balavarjite |
tad.hbhuktyAdau mahAklesho dAraputrAdipIDanam || 77||
rAjabhItikarashchaiva madhye tIrthakaro bhavet |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu hyapamR^ityurbhaviShyati || 78||
taddoShaparihArArthaM viShNusAhasrakaM japet |
tataH sukhamavApnoti shrIhareshcha prasAdataH || 79||
\section{atha shukrAntardashAphalAdhyAyaH || 60||}
atha svAntargate shukre lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
lAbhe vA balasaMyukte tad.hbhuktau cha shubhaM phalam || 1||
vipramUlAddhanaprAptirgomahiShyAdilAbhakR^it |
putrotsavAdisantoSho gR^ihe kalyANasambhavaH || 2||
sanmAnaM rAjasammAnaM rAjyalAbho mahatsukham |
svochche vA svarxage vApi tu~NgAMshe vAMshage.api vA || 3||
nUtanAlayanirmANaM nityaM miShThAnnabhojanam |
kalatraputravibhavaM mitrasaMyuktabhojanam || 4||
annadAnaM priyaM nityaM danadharmAdisa~NgrahaH |
mahArAjaprasAdena vAhanAmbarabhUShaNam || 5||
vyavasAyAtphalAdhikyaM chatuShpAjjIvalAbhakR^it |
prayANaM pashchime bhAge vAhanAmbaralAbhakR^it || 6||
lagnAdyupachaye shukre shubhagrahayutexite |
mitrAMshe tu~NgalAbheshayogalArakasaMyute || 7||
rAjyalAbho mahotsAho rAjaprItiH shubhAvahA |
gR^ihe kalyANasampattirdAraputrAdivarddhanam || 8||
ShaShThAShTamavyaye shukre pApayukte.atha vIxite |
chaurAdivraNabhItishcha sarvatra janapIDanam || 9||
rAjadvAre janadveSha iShTabandhuvinAshanam |
dAraputrAdipIDA cha sarvatra janapIDanam || 10||
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu sthite chenmaraNaM bhavet |
tarta durgAjapaM kuryAddhanudAnaM cha kArayet || 11||
shukrasyAntargate sUrye santApo rAjavigrahaH |
dAyAdakalahashchaiva svochchanIchavivarjite || 12||
(shukrasyAntargate sUrye santApo rAjabhiH kaliH |
dAyAdAt kalahashchaiva shubhaxetrAtya rAshige || 12||) |
svochche svaxetrage sUrye mitrarxe kendrakoNage |
dAyeshAtkendrakoNe vA lAbhe vA dhanage.api vA || 13||
tad.hbhuktau dhanalAbhaH syAdrAjyastrIdhanasampadaH |
svaprabhoshcha mahatsaukhyamiShTabandhoH samAgamaH || 14||
pitR^imAtroH sukhaprAptiM bhrAtR^ilAbhaM sukhAvaham |
satkIrtiM sukhasaubhAgyaM putralAbhaM cha vindati || 15||
tathAShTame vyaye sUrye ripurAshisthite.api vA |
nIche vA pApavargasthe dehatApo manorujaH || 16||
svajanoparisaMklesho nityaM niShThurabhAShaNam |
pitR^ipIDA bandhuhAnI rAjadvAre virodhakR^it || 17||
vraNapIDAhibAdhA cha svagR^ihe cha bhayaM tathA |
nAnArogabhayaM chaiva gR^ihaxetrAdinAshanam || 18||
saptamAdhipatau sUrye grahabAdhA bhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM sUryaprItiM cha kArayet || 19||
shukrasyAntargate chandre kendralAbhatrikoNage |
svochche svaxetrage chaiva bhAgyanAthenasaMyute || 20||
shubhayukte pUrNachandre rAjyanAthena saMyute |
tad.hbuktau vAhanAdInAM lAbhaM gehe mahatsukham || 21||
mahArAjaprasAdena gajAntaishvaryamAdishet |
mahAnadIsnAnapuNyaM devabrAhmaNapUjanam || 22||
gItavAdyaprasa~NgAdividvajjanavibhUShaNam |
gomahiShyAdivR^iddhishcha vyavasAye.adhikaM phalam || 23||
bhojanAmbarasaukhyaM cha bandhusaMyuktabhojanam |
nIche vAtsa~Ngate vApi ShaShThAShTamavyayarAshige || 24||
dAyeshAtShaShThage vApi randhre vA vyayarAshige |
tatkAle dhananAshaH syAtsa~nchareta mahad.hbhayam || 25||
dehAyAso manastApo rAjadvAre virodhakR^it |
videshagamanaM chaiva tIrthayAtrAdikaM phalam || 26||
dAraputrAdi pIDA cha nijabandhuviyogakR^it |
dAyeshAtkendralAbhasthe trikoNe sahaje.api vA || 27||
rAjaprItikarI chaiva deshagrAmAdhipatyatA |
dhairyaM yashaH sukhaM kIrtirvAhanAmbarabhUShaNam || 28||
kUpArAmataDAgadinirmANaM dhanasa~N.hgrahaH |
bhuktayAdau dehasaukhyaM syAdante kleshastathA bhavet || 29||
shukrasyAntargate bhaume lagnAtkendratrikoNage |
svochche vA svarxage bhaume lAbhe vA balasaMyute || 30||
lagnAdhipena saMyukte karmabhAgyeshasaMyute |
tad.hbhuktau rAjayogAdisampadaM shobhanAM vadet || 31||
vastrAbharaNabhUmyAderiShTasiddhiH sukhAvahA |
tathA.aShTame vyaye vA.api dAyeshAdvA tathaiva cha || 32||
shItajvarAdipIDA cha pitR^imAtR^ibhayAvahA |
jvarAdyadhikarogAshcha sthAnabhraMsho manorujA || 33||
svabandhujanahAnishcha kalaho rAjavigrahaH |
rAjadvArajanadveSho dhanadhAnyavyayo.adhikaH || 34||
vyavasAyAtphalaM neShTaM grAmabhUmyAdihAnikR^it |
dvitIyadyUnanAthe tu dehavAdhA bhaviShyati || 35||
shukrasyAntargate rAhau kendralAbhatrikoNage |
svochche vA shubhasaMdR^iShTe yogakArakasaMyute || 36||
tad.hbhuktau bahusaukhyaM cha dhanadhAnyAdilAbhakR^it |
iShTabandhusamAkIrNaM bhavanaM cha samAdishet || 37||
yAtuH kAryArthasiddhiH syAt pashuxetrAdisambhavaH |
lagnAdyupachaye rAhau tad.hbhuktiH sukhadA bhavet || 38||
shatrunAsho mahotsAho rAjaprItikarI shubhA |
bhuktyAdau sharamAsAMshcha ante jvaramajIrNakR^it || 39||
kAryavighnamavApnoti sa~nchare cha manovyathA |
paraM sukhaM cha saubhAgyaM mahArAja ivA.ashnute || 40||
nairR^itIM dishamAshritya prayANaM prabhudarshanam |
yAtuH kAryArthasiddhiH syAtsvadeshe punareShyati || 41||
upakAro brAhmaNAnAM tIrthayAtrAphalaM bhavet |
dAyeshAdrandhrabhAvasthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute || 42||
ashubhaM labhate karma pitR^imAtR^ijanAvadhi |
sarvatra janavidveShaM nAnArUpaM dvijottama || 43||
dvitIye saptame vApi dehAlasya vinirdishet |
taddoShaparihArArthaM mR^ityu~njayajapaM charet || 44||
shukrasyAntargate jIve svochche svaxetrakendrage |
dAyeshAchChubharAshisthe bhAgye vA putrarAshige || 45||
naShTarAjyAddhanaprAptimiShTArthAmbarasampadam |
mitraprabhoshcha sanmAnaM dhanadhAnyaM labhennaraH || 46||
rAjasammAnakIrtiM cha ashvAndolAdilAbhakR^it |
vidvatprabhusamAkIrNaM shAstrAparishramam || 47||
putrotsavAdisantoShamiShTabandhusamAgamam |
pitR^imAtR^isukhaprAptiM putrAdisaukhyamAdishet || 48||
dAyeshAtShaShTharAshisthe vyaye vA pApasaMyute |
rAjachaurAdipIDA cha dehapIDA bhaviShyati || 49||
AtmarugbandhukaShTaM syAtkalahena manovyathA |
sthAnachyutiM pravAsaM cha nAnArogaM samApnuyAt || 50||
dvitIyasaptamAdhIshe dehabAdhA bhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM mahAmR^ityu~njayaM charet || 51||
shukrasyAntargate mande svochche tu paramochchage |
svarxakendratrikoNasthe tu~NgAMshe svAMshage.api vA || 52||
tad.hbhuktau bahusaukhyaM syAdiShTabandhusamAgamaH |
rAjadvAre cha sammAnaM putrikAjanmasambhavaH || 53||
puNyatIrthaphalavAptirdAnadharmAdipuNyakR^it |
svaprabhoshcha padAvAptiH nIchasthe kleshabhAgyabhavet || 54||
dehAlasyamavApnoti tathA.ayAdadhikavyayam |
tathAShTame vyaye mande dAyeshAdvA tathaiva cha || 55||
bhuktyAdau vividhA pIDA pitR^imAtR^ijanAvadhi |
dAraputrAdipIDA cha paradeshAdivibhramaH || 56||
vyavasAyAtphalaM naShTaM gomahiShyAdihAnikR^it |
dvitIyasaptamAdhIshe dehabAdhA bhaviShyati || 57||
taddoShaparihArArthaM tilahomaM cha kArayet |
mR^ityu~njayajapaM kuryAchchaNDIpAThamAthapi vA || 58||
svayaM vA brAhmaNadvArA yathAshakti yathAvidhi |
tataH shAntimavApnoti shivAshambhuprasAdataH || 59||
shukrasyAntargate saumye kendre lAbhatrikoNage |
svochche vA svarxage vApi rAjaprItikaraM shubham || 60||
saubhAgyaM putralAbhashcha sanmArgeNa dhanAgamaH |
purANadharmashravaNaM shR^i~NgArijanasaMgamaH || 61||
iShTabandhujanAkIrNaM shobhitaM tasya mandiram |
svaprabhoshcha mahatsaukhyaM nityaM miShThAnnabhojanam || 62||
dAyeshAtShaShTharandhre vA vyaye vA balavarjite |
pApadR^iShTe pApayukte chatuShpAjjIvahAnikR^it || 63||
anyAlayanivAsashcha manovaikalyasambhavaH |
vyApAreShu cha sarveShu hAnireva na saMshayaH || 64||
bhuktyAdau shobhanaM proktaM madhye madhyaphalaM dishet |
ante kleshakaraM chaiva shItavAtajvarAdikam || 65||
saptamAdhIshadoSheNa dehapIDA bhaviShyati |
taddoShaparihArArthaM viShNusAhasrakaM japet || 66||
shukrasyAntargate ketau svochche vA svarxage.api vA |
yogakArakasambandhe sthAnavIryasamanvite || 67||
bhuktyAdau shubhamAdhikyAnnityaM miShThAnnabhojanam |
vyavasAyAtphalAdhikyaM gomahoShyAdivR^iddhikR^it || 68||
dhanadhAnyasamR^iddhishcha saMgrAme vijayo bhavet |
bhuktyante hi sukhaM chaiva bhuktyAdau madhyamaM phalam || 69||

